Name=\"adm-uid\">UID: {u.uid || \"\u2014\"}</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"adm-actions\">\n                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.email)}>Copy Email</button>\n                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.uid || \"\")}>Copy UID</button>\n                      <label className=\"adm-switch\">\n                        <input\n                          type=\"checkbox\"\n                          checked={verified}\n                          onChange={(e) => setVerifiedFor(u.email, e.target.checked)}\n                        />\n                        <span>Verified</span>\n                      </label>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                );\n              })}\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"admin-hint\">Sensitive emails are visible only to the super admin ({SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL}).</p>\n          </div>", "new_string": "          <div className=\"admin-section\">\n            <h3>\ud83d\udc65 User Management</h3>\n            <input\n              type=\"search\"\n              placeholder=\"Search by name, email, or UID\"\n              value={search}\n              onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}\n              className=\"admin-input\"\n              style={{ width: \"100%\" }}\n            />\n            <div className=\"admin-user-list\">\n              {filteredUsers.length === 0 && <p className=\"admin-hint\">No users registered yet.</p>}\n              {filteredUsers.map((u) => {\n                const verified = !!verifiedMap[u.email] || !!verifiedMap[u.uid];\n                return (\n                  <div key={u.uid || u.email} className=\"admin-user-row\">\n                    <div className=\"adm-avatar\">{(u.name || u.email || \"?\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>\n                    <div className=\"adm-info\">\n                      <div className=\"adm-name\">\n                        {u.name || \"(no name)\"}\n                        {verified && <BlueTick />}\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"adm-email\">{u.email}</div>\n                      <div className=\"adm-uid\">UID: {u.uid || \"\u2014\"}</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"adm-actions\">\n                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.email)}>Copy Email</button>\n                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.uid || \"\")}>Copy UID</button>\n                      <label className=\"adm-switch\">\n                        <input\n                          type=\"checkbox\"\n                          checked={verified}\n                          onChange={(e) => setVerifiedFor(u.email, e.target.checked)}\n                        />\n                        <span>Verified</span>\n                      </label>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                );\n              })}\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"admin-hint\">Sensitive emails are visible only to the super admin ({SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL}).</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"admin-section\">\n            <h3>\ud83d\udeab Ban / Strike Management</h3>\n            <AdminBanPanel />\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"admin-section\">\n            <h3>\ud83d\udccb Moderation Log</h3>\n            <AdminModerationLog />\n          </div>"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "bash", "arguments": {"command": "cat >> artifacts/animal-x/src/styles/app.css << 'CSSEOF'\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   PROFILE \u2014 Cover image + misc fixes\n   =================================================================== */\n.profile-cover-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 140px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a2e1a 0%, #0a1628 50%, #1a0a2e 100%);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.profile-cover-bg {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center;\n  background-repeat: no-repeat;\n}\n.profile-cover-gradient {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,197,94,0.3) 0%, rgba(14,165,233,0.2) 50%, rgba(168,85,247,0.2) 100%);\n}\n.profile-cover-edit-btn {\n  position: absolute; bottom: 10px; right: 12px;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); color: #fff;\n  border-radius: 8px; padding: 5px 10px;\n  cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n.profile-cover-edit-btn:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }\n\n/* Push avatar up so it overlaps the cover */\n.profile-page .profile-top {\n  margin-top: -32px;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n.profile-page .profile-avatar-btn {\n  border: 3px solid var(--bg) !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   ADMIN \u2014 Ban panel + moderation log\n   =================================================================== */\n.admin-ban-row {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n  padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.admin-ban-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.admin-ban-uid {\n  flex: 1; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 8px; color: var(--text); padding: 7px 10px;\n  font-size: 0.82rem; outline: none; font-family: monospace;\n}\n.admin-ban-btn {\n  padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: none;\n  font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; cursor: pointer;\n}\n.admin-ban-btn.ban { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.2); color: #ef4444; border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.4); }\n.admin-ban-btn.unban { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3); }\n.admin-ban-result {\n  font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); padding: 6px 0;\n  background: rgba(34,197,94,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; margin-top: 6px;\n}\n\n.admin-mod-log {\n  max-height: 280px; overflow-y: auto;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n}\n.mod-log-item {\n  background: var(--bg3); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px;\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n}\n.mod-log-item.strike { border-left-color: #f59e0b; }\n.mod-log-item.ban { border-left-color: #ef4444; }\n.mod-log-item.remove { border-left-color: #8b5cf6; }\n.mod-log-action { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; }\n.mod-log-detail { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.78rem; }\n.mod-log-time { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.7rem; }\n.mod-log-empty { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   TICK MSG TOAST\n   =================================================================== */\n.tick-msg-toast {\n  position: fixed; top: 80px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n  background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--accent);\n  color: var(--text); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 20px;\n  font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; z-index: 9999;\n  animation: toast-pop 0.3s ease;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n@keyframes toast-pop {\n  from { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-10px); opacity: 0; }\n  to   { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   HELP PAGE \u2014 Missing classes\n   =================================================================== */\n.help-page { padding: 0 0 80px; min-height: 100%; }\n.help-header { text-align: center; padding: 24px 16px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.help-ads-btn {\n  display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #16a34a);\n  color: #000; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n.help-tabs {\n  display: flex; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--bg2); z-index: 10;\n}\n.help-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n.help-tab {\n  flex-shrink: 0; padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: none; border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n  color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.help-tab.active { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }\n.help-grid { padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.section-title { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.contact-section, .faq-section, .contact-form-section { }\n.contact-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n.contact-card {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n  padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--bg3);\n  border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n.contact-card:hover { background: var(--border); }\n.contact-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.contact-label { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; }\n.contact-value { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.8rem; }\n.faq-item {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;\n  overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 8px; background: var(--bg3);\n}\n.faq-q {\n  padding: 12px 16px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem;\n  list-style: none; user-select: none;\n}\n.faq-q::marker { display: none; }\n.faq-a { padding: 0 16px 12px; color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n.help-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n.help-form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }\n.help-input {\n  width: 100%; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 10px; color: var(--text); padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 0.88rem; outline: none;\n}\n.help-input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }\n.help-textarea {\n  width: 100%; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 10px; color: var(--text); padding: 9px 12px;\n  font-size: 0.88rem; outline: none; resize: vertical; font-family: inherit;\n}\n.help-textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }\n.form-success {\n  text-align: center; padding: 32px 16px;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n}\n.help-content { padding: 16px; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.help-text { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.policy-section { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n.policy-section h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--accent); }\n.policy-section p { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n.community-rules { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.community-rule { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }\n.community-rule-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.community-rule-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 3px; }\n.community-rule-desc { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; }\n.report-section {\n  background: rgba(239,68,68,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);\n  border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; margin-top: 16px;\n}\n.report-section h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #fca5a5; }\n.report-section p { color: var(--text2); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n.report-section a { color: var(--accent); }\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   USER PROFILE \u2014 Not-found + missing classes\n   =================================================================== */\n.user-profile-page { min-height: 100%; background: var(--bg); padding-bottom: 80px; }\n.not-found {\n  text-align: center; padding: 60px 24px;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n}\n.up-empty { text-align: center; color: var(--text2); padding: 32px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem; }\n\n/* ===================================================================\n   RESPONSIVE \u2014 Mobile tweaks for new features\n   =================================================================== */\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .help-form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .ads-account-type-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .search-user-card { padding: 10px 12px; }\n  .search-user-avatar { width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 1.2rem; }\n  .profile-cover-wrap { height: 110px; }\n  .reels-page { height: calc(100dvh - var(--nav-h) - 64px); }\n}\nCSSEOF", "description": "Append final missing CSS for cover, admin ban, help, userprofile", "timeout": 15000}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The file artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Profile.jsx has been edited. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Profile.jsx:\n   433\u2192          <h3>Edit Profile</h3>\n   434\u2192          <div className=\"ep-photo-row\">\n   435\u2192            <div\n   436\u2192              className=\"ep-photo-preview\"\n   437\u2192              style={photoUrl ? { backgroundImage: `url(${photoUrl})` } : undefined}\n   438\u2192            >\n   439\u2192              {!photoUrl && initial}\n   440\u2192            </div>\n   441\u2192            <div style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n   442\u2192              <label className=\"btn-primary\" style={{ cursor: \"pointer\", display: \"inline-block\" }}>\n   443\u2192                \ud83d\udcf7 Upload New Photo\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected (correct indentation, no duplicate lines, etc). Edit the file again if necessary."}]}, {"role": "tool", "