       <div className=\"adm-actions\">\n   674\u2192                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.email)}>Copy Email</button>\n   675\u2192                      <button className=\"qs-pill\" onClick={() => copyText(u.uid || \"\")}>Copy UID</button>\n   676\u2192                      <label className=\"adm-switch\">\n   677\u2192                        <input\n   678\u2192                          type=\"checkbox\"\n   679\u2192                          checked={verified}\n   680\u2192                          onChange={(e) => setVerifiedFor(u.email, e.target.checked)}\n   681\u2192                        />\n   682\u2192                        <span>Verified</span>\n   683\u2192                      </label>\n   684\u2192                    </div>\n   685\u2192                  </div>\n   686\u2192                );\n   687\u2192              })}\n   688\u2192            </div>\n   689\u2192            <p className=\"admin-hint\">Sensitive emails are visible only to the super admin ({SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL}).</p>\n   690\u2192          </div>\n   691\u2192\n   692\u2192          <div className=\"admin-section\">\n   693\u2192            <h3>\ud83d\udeab Ban / Strike Management</h3>\n   694\u2192            <AdminBanPanel />\n   695\u2192          </div>\n   696\u2192\n   697\u2192          <div className=\"admin-section\">\n   698\u2192            <h3>\ud83d\udccb Moderation Log</h3>\n   699\u2192            <AdminModerationLog />\n   700\u2192          </div>\n   701\u2192        </div>\n   702\u2192      )}\n   703\u2192    </div>\n   704\u2192  );\nReview the changes and make sure they are as expected (correct indentation, no duplicate lines, etc). Edit the file again if necessary."}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command executed successfully.\nThere was no output."}]}]}
