mp/logs/artifactsapi-server_API_Server_20260627_015036_519.log\n- artifacts/mockup-sandbox: Component Preview Server: /tmp/logs/artifactsmockup-sandbox_Component_Previe_20260627_015036_709.log\nMost recent console log files: /tmp/logs/browser_console_20260627_015157_229.log\n/tmp/logs/browser_console_20260627_015036_892.log\n"}]}]}
