{"memory_id": 386, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<user_message>\nUpdate my Animal X app with a fully professional social media system. 100% working no glich no bugs \n Note:User reels play 100% working \nReels\n\u2022 Remove all DEMO_REELS, FAKE_FEED_REELS, and ALL_USERS demo data.\n\u2022 Show only real user uploaded reels from Firebase Firestore.\n\u2022 Fix autoplay so reels play smoothly while scrolling.\n\u2022 Only the active reel should play automatically.\n\u2022 Pause all other videos.\n\u2022 Enable like, comment, share, save, follow, mute, and delete.\n\u2022 Every reel must display: \n\u2022 Creator profile photo\n\u2022 Creator name\n\u2022 Verified badge (if verified)\n\u2022 Followers count\n\u2022 Likes count\n\u2022 Views count\n\u2022 Comments count\n\u2022 Shares count\n\u2022 Location\n\u2022 Category\n\u2022 Clicking the creator name or profile photo should open the creator profile.\n\u2022 Search must find users by username.\n\u2022 Opening a creator profile should display all of their uploaded reels.\n\u2022 Profile reel count must update automatically.\nProfile\n\u2022 Display: \n\u2022 Followers\n\u2022 Following\n\u2022 Total Likes\n\u2022 Total Views\n\u2022 Total Reels\n\u2022 Total Posts\n\u2022 Total Stories\n\u2022 Create a professional Creator Dashboard.\n\u2022 Dashboard should include: \n\u2022 Analytics\n\u2022 Daily views\n\u2022 Weekly views\n\u2022 Monthly views\n\u2022 Reel performance\n\u2022 Audience countries\n\u2022 Followers growth\n\u2022 Likes growth\n\u2022 Upload statistics\nStories\n\u2022 Add Instagram-style Stories.\n\u2022 Profile page must contain an \"Add Story\" button.\n\u2022 Users can upload image or video stories.\n\u2022 Stories expire automatically after 24 hours.\n\u2022 \n\u2022 Users can tap stories to watch.\n\u2022 Show story progress bar.\n\u2022 Show story viewer count.\nUpload System\n\u2022 Upload Reel\n\u2022 Upload Story\n\u2022 Upload Post\n\u2022 Store everything in Firebase Storage.\n\u2022 Save metadata in Firestore.\n\u2022 Update profile statistics automatically after every upload.\nSearch\n\u2022 Search by username.\n\u2022 Search by reel title.\n\u2022 Search by hashtags.\n\u2022 Search by category.\n\u2022 Clicking search results opens creator profile.\nDatabase\nUse only Firebase Firestore and Firebase Storage. Remove every fake/demo/local data source.\nPerformance\nUse lazy loading, pagination, virtualization, caching, optimized image loading, and smooth scrolling.\nFix all build errors and ensure the project compiles successfully with no TypeScript, React, or Vite errors.\n\n</user_message>\n"}]}]}
{"memory_id": 387, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Let me start by reading the current state of the key files before planning the full implementation:"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [], "tool_calls": [{"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx", "limit": 120}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "glob", "arguments": {"pattern": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/*.jsx"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "glob", "arguments": {"pattern": "artifacts/animal-x/src/components/*.jsx"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx (lines 1-120 of 299)\n     1\u2192import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\n     2\u2192import { useLocation, Link } from \"wouter\";\n     3\u2192import {\n     4\u2192  collection, query, orderBy, limit,\n     5\u2192  onSnapshot, doc, getDoc, setDoc, updateDoc,\n     6\u2192  increment, serverTimestamp, addDoc, deleteDoc\n     7\u2192} from \"firebase/firestore\";\n     8\u2192import { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\n     9\u2192import { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\n    10\u2192import { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\n    11\u2192import { DEMO_REELS, FAKE_FEED_REELS, ALL_USERS } from \"../data/demoUsers\";\n    12\u2192import BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\n    13\u2192import CommentsPanel from \"../components/CommentsPanel\";\n    14\u2192import UploadReel from \"../components/UploadReel\";\n    15\u2192\n    16\u2192function fmt(n) {\n    17\u2192  if (!n) return \"0\";\n    18\u2192  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n    19\u2192  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n    20\u2192  return String(n);\n    21\u2192}\n    22\u2192\n    23\u2192const CATS = [\"All\", \"Mammals\", \"Birds\", \"Aquatic\", \"Reptiles\", \"Small Creatures\", \"Trees\", \"Mountains\", \"Sea\", \"Desert\"];\n    24\u2192\n    25\u2192const WILDLIFE_KW = [\n    26\u2192  \"lion\", \"tiger\", \"elephant\", \"eagle\", \"wolf\", \"dolphin\", \"whale\", \"shark\", \"cheetah\", \"leopard\",\n    27\u2192  \"gorilla\", \"panda\", \"penguin\", \"crocodile\", \"jaguar\", \"orca\", \"falcon\", \"bear\", \"fox\", \"lynx\",\n    28\u2192  \"bison\", \"flamingo\", \"animal\", \"wildlife\", \"nature\", \"forest\", \"jungle\", \"bird\", \"ocean\", \"reptile\",\n    29\u2192  \"snake\", \"fish\", \"reef\", \"coral\", \"turtle\", \"frog\", \"insect\", \"safari\", \"savanna\", \"arctic\",\n    30\u2192  \"mountain\", \"desert\", \"rainforest\", \"conservation\", \"wild\", \"mammal\", \"primate\", \"raptor\", \"marine\"\n    31\u2192];\n    32\u2192\n    33\u2192function moderateContent(title, desc, hashtags) {\n    34\u2192  const text = `${title} ${desc} ${hashtags}`.toLowerCase();\n    35\u2192  return WILDLIFE_KW.some(w => text.includes(w));\n    36\u2192}\n    37\u2192\n    38\u2192function buildFeed(liveReels, catFilter) {\n    39\u2192  const all = [\n    40\u2192    ...liveReels.map(r => ({ ...r, _rank: 2000 + (r.likes || 0) * 0.01 + (Date.now() - (r.createdAt?.toMillis?.() || 0)) * -0.000001 })),\n    41\u2192    ...DEMO_REELS.map(r => ({ ...r, _rank: 800 + (r.likes || 0) * 0.005 })),\n    42\u2192    ...FAKE_FEED_REELS.slice(0, 80).map(r => ({ ...r, _rank: 200 + (r.likes || 0) * 0.001 }))\n    43\u2192  ];\n    44\u2192  const seen = new Set();\n    45\u2192  const deduped = all.filter(r => { if (seen.has(r.id)) return false; seen.add(r.id); return true; });\n    46\u2192  const filtered = catFilter === \"All\" ? deduped : deduped.filter(r => r.category === catFilter || r.cat === catFilter);\n    47\u2192  return filtered.sort((a, b) => b._rank - a._rank);\n    48\u2192}\n    49\u2192\n    50\u2192function getDemoUser(userId) {\n    51\u2192  return ALL_USERS.find(u => u.id === userId || u.username === userId);\n    52\u2192}\n    53\u2192\n    54\u2192export default function Reels() {\n    55\u2192  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n    56\u2192  const { user, adminMode, isSuperAdmin } = useAuth();\n    57\u2192  const { likedReels, likeReel, following, followUser, unfollowUser, trackReelView } = useSocial();\n    58\u2192\n    59\u2192  const [liveReels, setLiveReels] = useState([]);\n    60\u2192  const [feed, setFeed] = useState([]);\n    61\u2192  const [catFilter, setCatFilter] = useState(\"All\");\n    62\u2192  const [activeIdx, setActiveIdx] = useState(0);\n    63\u2192  const [muted, setMuted] = useState(false);\n    64\u2192  const [commentsReel, setCommentsReel] = useState(null);\n    65\u2192  const [uploadOpen, setUploadOpen] = useState(false);\n    66\u2192  const [heartAnims, setHeartAnims] = useState({});\n    67\u2192  const [savedReels, setSavedReels] = useState(() => {\n    68\u2192    try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"ax_saved_reels\") || \"{}\"); } catch { return {}; }\n    69\u2192  });\n    70\u2192  const [liveLikes, setLiveLikes] = useState({});\n    71\u2192  const [doubleTapTimeout, setDoubleTapTimeout] = useState({});\n    72\u2192\n    73\u2192  const scrollRef = useRef(null);\n    74\u2192  const videoRefs = useRef({});\n    75\u2192  const observerRef = useRef(null);\n    76\u2192  const lastTapRef = useRef({});\n    77\u2192\n    78\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    79\u2192    const q = query(collection(db, \"reels\"), orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"), limit(100));\n    80\u2192    const unsub = onSnapshot(q, snap => {\n    81\u2192      const reels = snap.docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data(), type: \"live\" }));\n    82\u2192      setLiveReels(reels);\n    83\u2192    });\n    84\u2192    return unsub;\n    85\u2192  }, []);\n    86\u2192\n    87\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    88\u2192    setFeed(buildFeed(liveReels, catFilter));\n    89\u2192    setActiveIdx(0);\n    90\u2192    if (scrollRef.current) scrollRef.current.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \"instant\" });\n    91\u2192  }, [liveReels, catFilter]);\n    92\u2192\n    93\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    94\u2192    if (!scrollRef.current || feed.length === 0) return;\n    95\u2192    observerRef.current?.disconnect();\n    96\u2192    const obs = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n    97\u2192      entries.forEach(entry => {\n    98\u2192        if (entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio >= 0.6) {\n    99\u2192          const idx = Number(entry.target.dataset.idx);\n   100\u2192          setActiveIdx(idx);\n   101\u2192          const reel = feed[idx];\n   102\u2192          if (reel?.id) trackReelView(reel.id);\n   103\u2192          Object.entries(videoRefs.current).forEach(([vi, el]) => {\n   104\u2192            if (!el) return;\n   105\u2192            if (Number(vi) === idx) { el.muted = muted; el.play().catch(() => {}); }\n   106\u2192            else { el.pause(); }\n   107\u2192          });\n   108\u2192        }\n   109\u2192      });\n   110\u2192    }, { threshold: 0.6, root: scrollRef.current });\n   111\u2192    const slides = scrollRef.current.querySelectorAll(\"[data-idx]\");\n   112\u2192    slides.forEach(s => obs.observe(s));\n   113\u2192    observerRef.current = obs;\n   114\u2192    return () => obs.disconnect();\n   115\u2192  }, [feed.length, muted]);\n   116\u2192\n   117\u2192  const triggerHeart = useCallback((id) => {\n   118\u2192    setHeartAnims(h => ({ ...h, [id]: true }));\n   119\u2192    setTimeout(() => setHeartAnims(h => ({ ...h, [id]: false })), 800);\n   120\u2192  }, []);"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No files found"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No files found"}]}]}
{"memory_id": 388, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Let me read all the critical files in parallel to understand the full current state:"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [], "tool_calls": [{"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx", "offset": 120, "limit": 180}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/data/demoUsers.js", "limit": 50}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "bash", "arguments": {"command": "ls artifacts/animal-x/src/components/ && ls artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/", "description": "List component and page files", "timeout": 5000}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/context/SocialContext.jsx", "limit": 80}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx (lines 120-299 of 299)\n   120\u2192  }, []);\n   121\u2192\n   122\u2192  async function handleLike(reel) {\n   123\u2192    if (!user) { navigate(\"/auth\"); return; }\n   124\u2192    const already = !!likedReels[reel.id];\n   125\u2192    if (!already) triggerHeart(reel.id);\n   126\u2192    setLiveLikes(p => ({ ...p, [reel.id]: (p[reel.id] ?? reel.likes ?? 0) + (already ? -1 : 1) }));\n   127\u2192    await likeReel(reel.id, reel.likes || 0);\n   128\u2192  }\n   129\u2192\n   130\u2192  function handleDoubleTap(reel, e) {\n   131\u2192    const now = Date.now();\n   132\u2192    const last = lastTapRef.current[reel.id] || 0;\n   133\u2192    if (now - last < 350) {\n   134\u2192      if (user && !likedReels[reel.id]) handleLike(reel);\n   135\u2192      else if (!user) triggerHeart(reel.id);\n   136\u2192    }\n   137\u2192    lastTapRef.current[reel.id] = now;\n   138\u2192  }\n   139\u2192\n   140\u2192  function handleSave(reelId) {\n   141\u2192    const next = { ...savedReels, [reelId]: !savedReels[reelId] };\n   142\u2192    if (!next[reelId]) delete next[reelId];\n   143\u2192    setSavedReels(next);\n   144\u2192    localStorage.setItem(\"ax_saved_reels\", JSON.stringify(next));\n   145\u2192  }\n   146\u2192\n   147\u2192  async function handleShare(reel) {\n   148\u2192    const text = `${reel.title} - Animal X Wildlife\\n#wildlifeapp`;\n   149\u2192    if (navigator.share) {\n   150\u2192      try { await navigator.share({ title: reel.title, text, url: window.location.href }); return; } catch {}\n   151\u2192    }\n   152\u2192    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert(\"Link copied!\"); } catch {}\n   153\u2192  }\n   154\u2192\n   155\u2192  async function handleDeleteReel(reelId) {\n   156\u2192    if (!window.confirm(\"Delete this reel?\")) return;\n   157\u2192    try { await deleteDoc(doc(db, \"reels\", reelId)); } catch (e) { alert(e.message); }\n   158\u2192  }\n   159\u2192\n   160\u2192  function handleFollowToggle(targetUserId) {\n   161\u2192    if (!user) { navigate(\"/auth\"); return; }\n   162\u2192    if (following[targetUserId]) unfollowUser(targetUserId);\n   163\u2192    else followUser(targetUserId);\n   164\u2192  }\n   165\u2192\n   166\u2192  return (\n   167\u2192    <div className=\"reels-page\">\n   168\u2192      <div className=\"reels-top-bar\">\n   169\u2192        <span className=\"reels-top-title\">\ud83c\udfa5 Wildlife Reels</span>\n   170\u2192        <div className=\"reels-top-actions\">\n   171\u2192          {user && (<button className=\"reels-upload-btn\" onClick={() => setUploadOpen(true)}>+ Upload</button>)}\n   172\u2192        </div>\n   173\u2192      </div>\n   174\u2192      <div className=\"reels-cat-bar\">\n   175\u2192        {CATS.map(c => (\n   176\u2192          <button key={c} className={`reel-cat-pill ${catFilter === c ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setCatFilter(c)}>{c}</button>\n   177\u2192        ))}\n   178\u2192      </div>\n   179\u2192      <div className=\"reels-scroll\" ref={scrollRef}>\n   180\u2192        {feed.length === 0 ? (\n   181\u2192          <div className=\"reels-empty\">\n   182\u2192            <div style={{ fontSize: \"4rem\" }}>\ud83e\udd81</div>\n   183\u2192            <h3>No reels yet</h3>\n   184\u2192            <p>Be the first to upload a wildlife reel!</p>\n   185\u2192          </div>\n   186\u2192        ) : (\n   187\u2192          feed.map((reel, idx) => {\n   188\u2192            const liked = !!likedReels[reel.id];\n   189\u2192            const saved = !!savedReels[reel.id];\n   190\u2192            const likes = liveLikes[reel.id] ?? reel.likes ?? 0;\n   191\u2192            const demoUser = getDemoUser(reel.userId);\n   192\u2192            const isOwn = user?.uid === reel.userId;\n   193\u2192            const isAdmin = isSuperAdmin && adminMode;\n   194\u2192            const isFollowed = !!following[reel.userId];\n   195\u2192            const isActive = idx === activeIdx;\n   196\u2192\n   197\u2192            return (\n   198\u2192              <div key={reel.id} className={`reel-item ${isActive ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} data-idx={idx} onClick={(e) => handleDoubleTap(reel, e)}>\n   199\u2192                {reel.videoUrl ? (\n   200\u2192                              <video\n   201\u2192              ref={el => {\n   202\u2192                if (el) videoRefs.current[idx] = el;\n   203\u2192              }}\n   204\u2192              className=\"reel-video\"\n   205\u2192              src={`/api/storage${reel.videoUrl}`}\n   206\u2192              poster={\n   207\u2192                reel.thumbnailUrl\n   208\u2192                  ? `/api/storage${reel.thumbnailUrl}`\n   209\u2192                  : undefined\n   210\u2192              }\n   211\u2192              preload=\"metadata\"\n   212\u2192              AutoPlay\n   213\u2192              loop\n   214\u2192              playsInline\n   215\u2192              muted={muted}\n   216\u2192            />\n   217\u2192\n   218\u2192                ) : (\n   219\u2192                  <div className=\"reel-demo-bg\" style={{ background: reel.bg || \"linear-gradient(135deg,#0f4c2a,#065f46)\" }}>\n   220\u2192                    <div className=\"reel-demo-emoji\">{reel.emoji || \"\ud83e\udd81\"}</div>\n   221\u2192                  </div>\n   222\u2192                )}\n   223\u2192                {heartAnims[reel.id] && (<div className=\"reel-heart-burst\">\u2764\ufe0f</div>)}\n   224\u2192                <div className=\"reel-gradient-overlay\" />\n   225\u2192                {reel.sponsored && (<div className=\"reel-sponsored-tag\">Sponsored</div>)}\n   226\u2192                <div className=\"reel-overlay-bottom\">\n   227\u2192                  <div className=\"reel-creator-row\">\n   228\u2192                    <Link href={`/user/${reel.userId}`} onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>\n   229\u2192                      <div className=\"reel-avatar\">{demoUser?.avatar || reel.userAvatar || (reel.username?.[0]?.toUpperCase() || \"\ud83e\udd81\")}</div>\n   230\u2192                    </Link>\n   231\u2192                    <div className=\"reel-creator-info\">\n   232\u2192                      <Link href={`/user/${reel.userId}`} onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()} className=\"reel-username-link\">\n   233\u2192                        @{reel.username || \"wildlifeuser\"}\n   234\u2192                        {(reel.userVerified || demoUser?.verified) && <BlueTick size={14} />}\n   235\u2192                      </Link>\n   236\u2192                    </div>\n   237\u2192                    {!isOwn && (\n   238\u2192                      <button className={`reel-follow-btn ${isFollowed ? \"following\" : \"\"}`} onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); handleFollowToggle(reel.userId); }}>\n   239\u2192                        {isFollowed ? \"Following\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n   240\u2192                      </button>\n   241\u2192                    )}\n   242\u2192                  </div>\n   243\u2192                  <div className=\"reel-title\">{reel.title}</div>\n   244\u2192                  {reel.desc && <div className=\"reel-desc\">{reel.desc.length > 80 ? reel.desc.slice(0, 80) + \"...\" : reel.desc}</div>}\n   245\u2192                  {reel.hashtags && (\n   246\u2192                    <div className=\"reel-hashtags\">\n   247\u2192                      {String(reel.hashtags).split(/[\\s,]+/).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 4).map(h => (\n   248\u2192                        <span key={h} className=\"reel-hashtag\">{h.startsWith(\"#\") ? h : \"#\" + h}</span>\n   249\u2192                      ))}\n   250\u2192                    </div>\n   251\u2192                  )}\n   252\u2192                  <div className=\"reel-meta-row\">\n   253\u2192                    <span>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f{fmt(reel.views || 0)}</span>\n   254\u2192                    <span>\ud83d\udd17{fmt(reel.shares || 0)}</span>\n   255\u2192                    {reel.location && <span>\ud83d\udccd{reel.location}</span>}\n   256\u2192                    <span className=\"reel-cat-badge\">{reel.category || reel.cat}</span>\n   257\u2192                  </div>\n   258\u2192                </div>\n   259\u2192                <div className=\"reel-actions-right\">\n   260\u2192                  <div className=\"reel-action-col\">\n   261\u2192                    <button className={`reel-action-btn like-btn ${liked ? \"liked\" : \"\"}`} onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); handleLike(reel); }}>\n   262\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{liked ? \"\u2764\ufe0f\" : \"\ud83e\udd0d\"}</span>\n   263\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(likes)}</span>\n   264\u2192                    </button>\n   265\u2192                    <button className=\"reel-action-btn\" onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); setCommentsReel(reel); }}>\n   266\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\ud83d\udcac</span>\n   267\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(reel.comments || 0)}</span>\n   268\u2192                    </button>\n   269\u2192                    <button className=\"reel-action-btn\" onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); handleShare(reel); }}>\n   270\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\u2197\ufe0f</span>\n   271\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(reel.shares || 0)}</span>\n   272\u2192                    </button>\n   273\u2192                    <button className={`reel-action-btn ${saved ? \"saved\" : \"\"}`} onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); handleSave(reel.id); }}>\n   274\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{saved ? \"\ud83d\udccc\" : \"\ud83d\udccd\"}</span>\n   275\u2192                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">Save</span>\n   276\u2192                    </button>\n   277\u2192                    {reel.videoUrl && (\n   278\u2192                      <button className=\"reel-action-btn\" onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); setMuted(m => !m); }}>\n   279\u2192                        <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{muted ? \"\ud83d\udd07\" : \"\ud83d\udd0a\"}</span>\n   280\u2192                        <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{muted ? \"Muted\" : \"Sound\"}</span>\n   281\u2192                      </button>\n   282\u2192                    )}\n   283\u2192                    {(isOwn || isAdmin) && (\n   284\u2192                      <button className=\"reel-action-btn danger-btn\" onClick={(e) => { e.stopPropagation(); handleDeleteReel(reel.id); }}>\n   285\u2192                        <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f</span>\n   286\u2192                        <span className=\"reel-action-count\">Delete</span>\n   287\u2192                      </button>\n   288\u2192                    )}\n   289\u2192                  </div>\n   290\u2192                </div>\n   291\u2192              </div>\n   292\u2192            );\n   293\u2192          })\n   294\u2192        )}\n   295\u2192      </div>\n   296\u2192    </div>\n   297\u2192  );\n   298\u2192}\n   299\u2192"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/data/demoUsers.js (lines 1-50 of 268)\n     1\u2192/* ============================================================\n     2\u2192   DEMO / FAKE USER SEED DATA\n     3\u2192   - 20 original hero creators (du01\u2013du20)\n     4\u2192   - 180 procedurally-generated wildlife users (fu001\u2013fu180)\n     5\u2192   - Total: 200 users\n     6\u2192   - Each fake user: 20 reels \u2192 3600 generated + 26 original = 3626 total\n     7\u2192   ============================================================ */\n     8\u2192\n     9\u2192/* ---------- original 20 hero creators ---------- */\n    10\u2192export const DEMO_USERS = [\n    11\u2192  { id:\"du01\", username:\"wildlion_africa\",   name:\"Leo Mwangi\",       verified:true,  country:\"Kenya\",       bio:\"Chasing sunsets and lions across Maasai Mara \ud83e\udd81\",   avatar:\"\ud83e\udd81\", followers:248000, following:312, reelCount:156 },\n    12\u2192  { id:\"du02\", username:\"ocean_queen_mia\",   name:\"Mia Nakamura\",     verified:true,  country:\"Japan\",       bio:\"Freediver & marine photographer \ud83c\udf0a\",                 avatar:\"\ud83d\udc2c\", followers:412000, following:890, reelCount:203 },\n    13\u2192  { id:\"du03\", username:\"safari_steve\",      name:\"Steve Odhiambo\",   verified:false, country:\"Tanzania\",    bio:\"Guide at Serengeti NP since 2010 \ud83d\udc18\",                avatar:\"\ud83d\udc18\", followers:87000,  following:421, reelCount:89  },\n    14\u2192  { id:\"du04\", username:\"eagle_eye_anya\",    name:\"Anya Petrov\",      verified:true,  country:\"Russia\",      bio:\"Raptor researcher & wildlife cinematographer \ud83e\udd85\",     avatar:\"\ud83e\udd85\", followers:193000, following:201, reelCount:178 },\n    15\u2192  { id:\"du05\", username:\"reptile_realm\",     name:\"Carlos Mendez\",    verified:false, country:\"Brazil\",      bio:\"Herpetologist studying Amazonian reptiles \ud83d\udc0d\",        avatar:\"\ud83d\udc0d\", followers:62000,  following:543, reelCount:67  },\n    16\u2192  { id:\"du06\", username:\"wolf_tracker_nw\",   name:\"Nathan Wolf\",      verified:true,  country:\"Canada\",      bio:\"Wolf pack researcher in Yellowstone \ud83d\udc3a\",              avatar:\"\ud83d\udc3a\", followers:314000, following:278, reelCount:215 },\n    17\u2192  { id:\"du07\", username:\"birdwatch_bella\",   name:\"Isabella Ferraro\", verified:false, country:\"Italy\",       bio:\"Birding across 80 countries \ud83e\udd9c\",                     avatar:\"\ud83e\udd9c\", followers:58000,  following:1200,reelCount:44  },\n    18\u2192  { id:\"du08\", username:\"deep_sea_divers\",   name:\"Marco Torres\",     verified:true,  country:\"Philippines\", bio:\"Coral restoration diver \ud83e\udeb8\",                         avatar:\"\ud83d\udc20\", followers:221000, following:339, reelCount:132 },\n    19\u2192  { id:\"du09\", username:\"savanna_stories\",   name:\"Amara Diallo\",     verified:false, country:\"Senegal\",     bio:\"African wildlife storyteller & blogger \ud83c\udf0d\",           avatar:\"\ud83e\udd92\", followers:94000,  following:678, reelCount:71  },\n    20\u2192  { id:\"du10\", username:\"polar_explorer_k\",  name:\"Katja Lund\",       verified:true,  country:\"Norway\",      bio:\"Arctic wildlife guide & polar bear researcher \u2744\ufe0f\",    avatar:\"\ud83d\udc3b\u200d\u2744\ufe0f\", followers:376000, following:156, reelCount:244 },\n    21\u2192  { id:\"du11\", username:\"jungle_nat\",        name:\"Natalia Cruz\",     verified:false, country:\"Colombia\",    bio:\"Amazon jungle guide & tree frog enthusiast \ud83d\udc38\",       avatar:\"\ud83d\udc38\", followers:41000,  following:820, reelCount:38  },\n    22\u2192  { id:\"du12\", username:\"desertdog_ali\",     name:\"Ali Hassan\",       verified:false, country:\"UAE\",         bio:\"Desert fox tracker & dune photographer \ud83e\udd8a\",           avatar:\"\ud83e\udd8a\", followers:73000,  following:412, reelCount:56  },\n    23\u2192  { id:\"du13\", username:\"sky_ranger_tom\",    name:\"Tom Eriksen\",      verified:true,  country:\"Sweden\",      bio:\"Drone cinematographer capturing wildlife from above \ud83c\udfa5\",avatar:\"\ud83e\udd86\", followers:289000, following:234, reelCount:189 },\n    24\u2192  { id:\"du14\", username:\"turtle_tales\",      name:\"Priya Sharma\",     verified:false, country:\"India\",       bio:\"Sea turtle conservationist, Odisha coast \ud83d\udc22\",         avatar:\"\ud83d\udc22\", followers:112000, following:567, reelCount:83  },\n    25\u2192  { id:\"du15\", username:\"forest_whisperer\",  name:\"Yuki Tanaka\",      verified:true,  country:\"Japan\",       bio:\"Red panda & snow leopard photographer \ud83d\udc06\",            avatar:\"\ud83d\udc06\", followers:521000, following:189, reelCount:312 },\n    26\u2192  { id:\"du16\", username:\"reef_ranger_oz\",    name:\"Olivia Chen\",      verified:false, country:\"Australia\",   bio:\"Great Barrier Reef guardian & marine biologist \ud83e\udeb8\",   avatar:\"\ud83d\udc21\", followers:138000, following:740, reelCount:97  },\n    27\u2192  { id:\"du17\", username:\"pangolin_patrol\",   name:\"David Kimani\",     verified:true,  country:\"Kenya\",       bio:\"Anti-poaching advocate & pangolin rescuer \ud83e\udd94\",        avatar:\"\ud83e\udd94\", followers:197000, following:302, reelCount:143 },\n    28\u2192  { id:\"du18\", username:\"mountain_monarch\",  name:\"Ravi Gupta\",       verified:false, country:\"Nepal\",       bio:\"Himalayan trekker & snow leopard spotter \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f\",         avatar:\"\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f\", followers:89000,  following:631, reelCount:62  },\n    29\u2192  { id:\"du19\", username:\"wildflower_wren\",   name:\"Sophie Laurent\",   verified:true,  country:\"France\",      bio:\"Pollinator & wildflower conservation photographer \ud83c\udf38\",avatar:\"\ud83c\udf38\", followers:345000, following:421, reelCount:267 },\n    30\u2192  { id:\"du20\", username:\"cheetah_chaser\",    name:\"James Mutua\",      verified:false, country:\"Kenya\",       bio:\"Cheetah Coalition field researcher & tracker \ud83d\udc06\",     avatar:\"\ud83d\udc06\", followers:67000,  following:880, reelCount:51  },\n    31\u2192];\n    32\u2192\n    33\u2192/* ---------- procedural generator seeds ---------- */\n    34\u2192const _PREFIXES = [\n    35\u2192  \"wild\",\"safari\",\"nature\",\"jungle\",\"ocean\",\"forest\",\"desert\",\"mountain\",\n    36\u2192  \"polar\",\"reef\",\"savanna\",\"wetland\",\"rainforest\",\"arctic\",\"coastal\",\n    37\u2192  \"nocturnal\",\"aerial\",\"aquatic\",\"highland\",\"grassland\",\n    38\u2192];\n    39\u2192const _ANIMALS = [\n    40\u2192  \"lion\",\"tiger\",\"elephant\",\"eagle\",\"wolf\",\"dolphin\",\"whale\",\"shark\",\n    41\u2192  \"cheetah\",\"leopard\",\"gorilla\",\"panda\",\"penguin\",\"crocodile\",\"jaguar\",\n    42\u2192  \"manta\",\"orca\",\"falcon\",\"bear\",\"fox\",\"lynx\",\"bison\",\"antelope\",\"flamingo\",\n    43\u2192];\n    44\u2192const _COUNTRIES = [\n    45\u2192  \"Kenya\",\"Tanzania\",\"South Africa\",\"India\",\"Brazil\",\"Indonesia\",\"Canada\",\n    46\u2192  \"Australia\",\"Norway\",\"Japan\",\"Philippines\",\"Colombia\",\"Nepal\",\"France\",\n    47\u2192  \"Sweden\",\"Thailand\",\"Mexico\",\"New Zealand\",\"Costa Rica\",\"Ethiopia\",\n    48\u2192  \"Zambia\",\"Botswana\",\"Ecuador\",\"Malaysia\",\"Sri Lanka\",\"Uganda\",\"Peru\",\n    49\u2192  \"Madagascar\",\"Namibia\",\"Zimbabwe\",\n    50\u2192];"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command executed successfully.\nThe output was\n```\nAdminDebugPanel.jsx  CategoryFilter.jsx    TripBanner.jsx\nAdminModerationPanel.jsx  CommentsPanel.jsx    ui\nAdminTestingPanel.jsx  FirebaseStatusBanner.jsx  UploadReel.jsx\nAnimalCard.jsx  Navbar.jsx    WildlifeAI.jsx\nAutoTickPopup.jsx  NotificationBell.jsx\nBlueTick.jsx  PerformanceBenchmark.jsx\nAds.jsx games    Profile.jsx\nAnimalDetail.jsx Games    Reels.jsx\nAnimalPuzzle.jsx HelpDesk.jsx    Search.jsx\nAnimals.jsx Home.jsx    TermsOfService.jsx\nAuth.jsx Map.jsx    Travel.jsx\nChatbot.jsx not-found.tsx    UserProfile.jsx\nCommunityGuidelines.jsx  PrivacyPolicy.jsx\n```"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/context/SocialContext.jsx (lines 1-80 of 251)\n     1\u2192import { createContext, useContext, useState, useEffect, useCallback, useRef } from \"react\";\n     2\u2192import {\n     3\u2192  doc, setDoc, getDoc, collection,\n     4\u2192  query, where, onSnapshot, orderBy, limit,\n     5\u2192  serverTimestamp, updateDoc, increment, addDoc,\n     6\u2192} from \"firebase/firestore\";\n     7\u2192import { ref, onValue, set as rtdbSet, onDisconnect } from \"firebase/database\";\n     8\u2192import { db, rtdb } from \"../utils/firebase\";\n     9\u2192import { reportFirebaseError } from \"../components/FirebaseStatusBanner\";\n    10\u2192import { useAuth } from \"./AuthContext\";\n    11\u2192\n    12\u2192function silentCatch(err) {\n    13\u2192  if (err?.code) reportFirebaseError(err.code, \"Firestore\");\n    14\u2192}\n    15\u2192\n    16\u2192const EMPTY_CTX = {\n    17\u2192  likedReels: {}, likeReel: () => Promise.resolve(),\n    18\u2192  following: {}, followUser: () => Promise.resolve(), unfollowUser: () => Promise.resolve(),\n    19\u2192  notifications: [], unreadCount: 0, markAllRead: () => Promise.resolve(),\n    20\u2192  broadcast: null, dismissBroadcast: () => Promise.resolve(),\n    21\u2192  sendBroadcast: () => Promise.resolve(), submitAd: () => Promise.resolve(false),\n    22\u2192  onlineCount: 0, liveViews: {}, trending: [],\n    23\u2192  trackReelView: () => {}, likeReelLive: () => {},\n    24\u2192  autoTickPopup: false, dismissAutoTickPopup: () => {},\n    25\u2192};\n    26\u2192const SocialContext = createContext(EMPTY_CTX);\n    27\u2192\n    28\u2192export function SocialProvider({ children }) {\n    29\u2192  const { user, profile, updateProfile } = useAuth();\n    30\u2192  const [likedReels, setLikedReels] = useState({});\n    31\u2192  const [following, setFollowing] = useState({});\n    32\u2192  const [notifications, setNotifications] = useState([]);\n    33\u2192  const [unreadCount, setUnreadCount] = useState(0);\n    34\u2192  const [broadcast, setBroadcast] = useState(null);\n    35\u2192  const [onlineCount, setOnlineCount] = useState(0);\n    36\u2192  const [liveViews, setLiveViews] = useState({});\n    37\u2192  const [trending, setTrending] = useState([]);\n    38\u2192  const [autoTickPopup, setAutoTickPopup] = useState(false);\n    39\u2192  const prevFollowers = useRef(0);\n    40\u2192\n    41\u2192  /* Auto blue tick at 100K followers */\n    42\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    43\u2192    if (!user?.uid || !profile) return;\n    44\u2192    const f = profile.followers || 0;\n    45\u2192    if (f >= 100000 && prevFollowers.current < 100000 && !profile.manualVerified && !profile.autoVerifiedAt) {\n    46\u2192      updateProfile({ autoVerifiedAt: Date.now(), manualVerified: true }).catch(() => {});\n    47\u2192      setAutoTickPopup(true);\n    48\u2192    }\n    49\u2192    prevFollowers.current = f;\n    50\u2192  }, [profile?.followers]);\n    51\u2192\n    52\u2192  function dismissAutoTickPopup() { setAutoTickPopup(false); }\n    53\u2192\n    54\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    55\u2192    if (!user?.uid) {\n    56\u2192      setLikedReels({}); setFollowing({}); setNotifications([]); setUnreadCount(0);\n    57\u2192      return;\n    58\u2192    }\n    59\u2192    const cached = {};\n    60\u2192    try { Object.assign(cached, JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(`ax_liked_${user.uid}`) || \"{}\")); } catch {}\n    61\u2192    setLikedReels(cached);\n    62\u2192\n    63\u2192    const followCached = {};\n    64\u2192    try { Object.assign(followCached, JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(`ax_following_${user.uid}`) || \"{}\")); } catch {}\n    65\u2192    setFollowing(followCached);\n    66\u2192\n    67\u2192    loadUserLikes(user.uid);\n    68\u2192    loadUserFollowing(user.uid);\n    69\u2192\n    70\u2192    const notifUnsub = onSnapshot(\n    71\u2192      query(collection(db, \"notifications\"), where(\"targetUid\", \"==\", user.uid), orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"), limit(30)),\n    72\u2192      (snap) => {\n    73\u2192        const items = snap.docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() }));\n    74\u2192        setNotifications(items);\n    75\u2192        setUnreadCount(items.filter(n => !n.read).length);\n    76\u2192      },\n    77\u2192      () => {}\n    78\u2192    );\n    79\u2192    return notifUnsub;\n    80\u2192  }, [user?.uid]);"}]}]}
{"memory_id": 389, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Let me read the remaining key files before writing:"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [], "tool_calls": [{"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx", "limit": 100}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/components/CommentsPanel.jsx", "limit": 80}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/utils/firebase.js"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/context/SocialContext.jsx", "offset": 80, "limit": 171}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx (lines 1-100 of 246)\n     1\u2192import { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\n     2\u2192import { useParams, Link, useLocation } from \"wouter\";\n     3\u2192import { doc, getDoc, updateDoc, setDoc } from \"firebase/firestore\";\n     4\u2192import { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\n     5\u2192import { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\n     6\u2192import { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\n     7\u2192import { ALL_USERS, getUserReels, FAKE_USERS } from \"../data/demoUsers\";\n     8\u2192import BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\n     9\u2192\n    10\u2192function fmtNum(n) {\n    11\u2192  if (!n) return \"0\";\n    12\u2192  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n    13\u2192  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n    14\u2192  return String(n);\n    15\u2192}\n    16\u2192\n    17\u2192export default function UserProfile() {\n    18\u2192  const { userId } = useParams();\n    19\u2192  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n    20\u2192  const { user: currentUser, isSuperAdmin, adminMode } = useAuth();\n    21\u2192  const { following, followUser, unfollowUser } = useSocial();\n    22\u2192  const [profile, setProfile] = useState(null);\n    23\u2192  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n    24\u2192  const [userReels, setUserReels] = useState([]);\n    25\u2192  const [tab, setTab] = useState(\"reels\"); // reels | followers | following\n    26\u2192  const [followersList, setFollowersList] = useState([]);\n    27\u2192  const [followingList, setFollowingList] = useState([]);\n    28\u2192  const [tickMsg, setTickMsg] = useState(null);\n    29\u2192\n    30\u2192  const isFollowing = !!following[userId];\n    31\u2192\n    32\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    33\u2192    async function load() {\n    34\u2192      setLoading(true);\n    35\u2192      const demo = ALL_USERS.find(u => u.id === userId || u.username === userId);\n    36\u2192      if (demo) {\n    37\u2192        const prof = {\n    38\u2192          uid: demo.id, name: demo.name, username: demo.username,\n    39\u2192          bio: demo.bio, country: demo.country,\n    40\u2192          followers: demo.followers, following: demo.following,\n    41\u2192          reels: demo.reelCount, isVerified: demo.verified, avatar: demo.avatar,\n    42\u2192        };\n    43\u2192        setProfile(prof);\n    44\u2192        setUserReels(getUserReels(demo.id));\n    45\u2192        // Build fake followers/following lists from ALL_USERS\n    46\u2192        const seedN = parseInt(demo.id.replace(/\\D/g, \"\")) || 1;\n    47\u2192        const fakeFollowers = ALL_USERS\n    48\u2192          .filter((u, i) => u.id !== demo.id && (i % (seedN % 5 + 2) === 0))\n    49\u2192          .slice(0, Math.min(demo.followers, 30));\n    50\u2192        const fakeFollowing = ALL_USERS\n    51\u2192          .filter((u, i) => u.id !== demo.id && (i % (seedN % 3 + 1) === 0))\n    52\u2192          .slice(0, Math.min(demo.following, 30));\n    53\u2192        setFollowersList(fakeFollowers);\n    54\u2192        setFollowingList(fakeFollowing);\n    55\u2192        setLoading(false);\n    56\u2192        return;\n    57\u2192      }\n    58\u2192      try {\n    59\u2192        const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \"users\", userId));\n    60\u2192        if (snap.exists()) {\n    61\u2192          const data = snap.data();\n    62\u2192          setProfile({ uid: userId, ...data });\n    63\u2192          // load followers/following from Firestore\n    64\u2192          try {\n    65\u2192            const [fSnap, fgSnap] = await Promise.all([\n    66\u2192              getDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowers\", userId)),\n    67\u2192              getDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowing\", userId)),\n    68\u2192            ]);\n    69\u2192            const fIds = Object.keys(fSnap.data()?.followers || {}).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 30);\n    70\u2192            const fgIds = Object.keys(fgSnap.data()?.following || {}).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 30);\n    71\u2192            // Resolve names from ALL_USERS or minimal stubs\n    72\u2192            setFollowersList(fIds.map(id => ALL_USERS.find(u => u.id === id) || { id, username: id, name: id }));\n    73\u2192            setFollowingList(fgIds.map(id => ALL_USERS.find(u => u.id === id) || { id, username: id, name: id }));\n    74\u2192          } catch {}\n    75\u2192        } else {\n    76\u2192          setProfile(null);\n    77\u2192        }\n    78\u2192      } catch { setProfile(null); }\n    79\u2192      setLoading(false);\n    80\u2192    }\n    81\u2192    load();\n    82\u2192  }, [userId]);\n    83\u2192\n    84\u2192  async function handleGiveTick(give) {\n    85\u2192    const target = ALL_USERS.find(u => u.id === userId);\n    86\u2192    if (target) {\n    87\u2192      target.verified = give;\n    88\u2192      setProfile(p => ({ ...p, isVerified: give }));\n    89\u2192      setTickMsg(give ? \"\u2705 Blue tick granted!\" : \"\u274c Blue tick removed!\");\n    90\u2192      setTimeout(() => setTickMsg(null), 3000);\n    91\u2192      return;\n    92\u2192    }\n    93\u2192    try {\n    94\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"users\", userId), { manualVerified: give }, { merge: true });\n    95\u2192      setProfile(p => ({ ...p, isVerified: give, manualVerified: give }));\n    96\u2192      setTickMsg(give ? \"\u2705 Blue tick granted!\" : \"\u274c Blue tick removed!\");\n    97\u2192      setTimeout(() => setTickMsg(null), 3000);\n    98\u2192    } catch (e) { alert(\"Error: \" + e.message); }\n    99\u2192  }\n   100\u2192"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/components/CommentsPanel.jsx (lines 1-80 of 142)\n     1\u2192import { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \"react\";\n     2\u2192import {\n     3\u2192  collection, query, orderBy, limit, onSnapshot,\n     4\u2192  addDoc, serverTimestamp, deleteDoc, doc\n     5\u2192} from \"firebase/firestore\";\n     6\u2192import { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\n     7\u2192import { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\n     8\u2192import BlueTick from \"./BlueTick\";\n     9\u2192\n    10\u2192function fmt(n) {\n    11\u2192  if (!n) return \"0\";\n    12\u2192  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n    13\u2192  return String(n);\n    14\u2192}\n    15\u2192\n    16\u2192export default function CommentsPanel({ reel, onClose }) {\n    17\u2192  const { user, profile, isSuperAdmin, adminMode } = useAuth();\n    18\u2192  const [comments, setComments] = useState([]);\n    19\u2192  const [text, setText] = useState(\"\");\n    20\u2192  const [submitting, setSubmitting] = useState(false);\n    21\u2192  const panelRef = useRef(null);\n    22\u2192  const inputRef = useRef(null);\n    23\u2192\n    24\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    25\u2192    if (!reel?.id) return;\n    26\u2192    const q = query(\n    27\u2192      collection(db, \"reels\", reel.id, \"comments\"),\n    28\u2192      orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"asc\"),\n    29\u2192      limit(100)\n    30\u2192    );\n    31\u2192    const unsub = onSnapshot(q, snap => {\n    32\u2192      setComments(snap.docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() })));\n    33\u2192    }, () => setComments([]));\n    34\u2192    return unsub;\n    35\u2192  }, [reel?.id]);\n    36\u2192\n    37\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    38\u2192    function onKey(e) { if (e.key === \"Escape\") onClose(); }\n    39\u2192    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", onKey);\n    40\u2192    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", onKey);\n    41\u2192  }, [onClose]);\n    42\u2192\n    43\u2192  async function handleSubmit(e) {\n    44\u2192    e.preventDefault();\n    45\u2192    if (!user) { alert(\"Please login to comment.\"); return; }\n    46\u2192    const t = text.trim();\n    47\u2192    if (!t) return;\n    48\u2192    setSubmitting(true);\n    49\u2192    try {\n    50\u2192      await addDoc(collection(db, \"reels\", reel.id, \"comments\"), {\n    51\u2192        text: t,\n    52\u2192        userId: user.uid,\n    53\u2192        username: profile?.username || user.name || user.email?.split(\"@\")[0],\n    54\u2192        userVerified: profile?.manualVerified || false,\n    55\u2192        createdAt: serverTimestamp(),\n    56\u2192      });\n    57\u2192      setText(\"\");\n    58\u2192    } catch {}\n    59\u2192    setSubmitting(false);\n    60\u2192  }\n    61\u2192\n    62\u2192  async function handleDelete(commentId) {\n    63\u2192    try { await deleteDoc(doc(db, \"reels\", reel.id, \"comments\", commentId)); } catch {}\n    64\u2192  }\n    65\u2192\n    66\u2192  function timeAgo(ts) {\n    67\u2192    if (!ts?.toDate) return \"\";\n    68\u2192    const diff = (Date.now() - ts.toDate().getTime()) / 1000;\n    69\u2192    if (diff < 60) return \"just now\";\n    70\u2192    if (diff < 3600) return Math.floor(diff / 60) + \"m\";\n    71\u2192    if (diff < 86400) return Math.floor(diff / 3600) + \"h\";\n    72\u2192    return Math.floor(diff / 86400) + \"d\";\n    73\u2192  }\n    74\u2192\n    75\u2192  return (\n    76\u2192    <div className=\"comments-backdrop\" onClick={e => { if (e.target === e.currentTarget) onClose(); }}>\n    77\u2192      <div className=\"comments-panel\" ref={panelRef}>\n    78\u2192        <div className=\"comments-header\">\n    79\u2192          <span className=\"comments-title\">\ud83d\udcac Comments ({comments.length})</span>\n    80\u2192          <button className=\"comments-close\" onClick={onClose}>\u2715</button>"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/utils/firebase.js\n     1\u2192import { initializeApp, getApps, getApp } from \"firebase/app\";\n     2\u2192import { getAuth } from \"firebase/auth\";\n     3\u2192import {\n     4\u2192  initializeFirestore,\n     5\u2192  persistentLocalCache,\n     6\u2192  persistentMultipleTabManager,\n     7\u2192  getFirestore,\n     8\u2192} from \"firebase/firestore\";\n     9\u2192import { getDatabase } from \"firebase/database\";\n    10\u2192\n    11\u2192\n    12\u2192const firebaseConfig = {\n    13\u2192  apiKey: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY,\n    14\u2192  authDomain: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN,\n    15\u2192  databaseURL: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL,\n    16\u2192  projectId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n    17\u2192  storageBucket: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET,\n    18\u2192  messagingSenderId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID,\n    19\u2192  appId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID,\n    20\u2192  measurementId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID,\n    21\u2192};\n    22\u2192\n    23\u2192const app = getApps().length === 0 ? initializeApp(firebaseConfig) : getApp();\n    24\u2192\n    25\u2192let db;\n    26\u2192try {\n    27\u2192  db = initializeFirestore(app, {\n    28\u2192    localCache: persistentLocalCache({\n    29\u2192      tabManager: persistentMultipleTabManager(),\n    30\u2192    }),\n    31\u2192  });\n    32\u2192} catch {\n    33\u2192  db = getFirestore(app);\n    34\u2192}\n    35\u2192\n    36\u2192export const auth = getAuth(app);\n    37\u2192export { db };\n    38\u2192export const rtdb = getDatabase(app);\n    39\u2192\n    40\u2192export const VAPID_KEY = import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY;\n    41\u2192\n    42\u2192export let messaging = null;\n    43\u2192if (typeof window !== \"undefined\" && \"serviceWorker\" in navigator && \"Notification\" in window) {\n    44\u2192  import(\"firebase/messaging\").then(({ getMessaging }) => {\n    45\u2192    try {\n    46\u2192      messaging = getMessaging(app);\n    47\u2192    } catch {}\n    48\u2192  });\n    49\u2192}\n    50\u2192\n    51\u2192export default app;\n    52\u2192"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/context/SocialContext.jsx (lines 80-250 of 251)\n    80\u2192  }, [user?.uid]);\n    81\u2192\n    82\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    83\u2192    const unsub = onSnapshot(\n    84\u2192      query(collection(db, \"adminBroadcasts\"), where(\"active\", \"==\", true), limit(1)),\n    85\u2192      (snap) => {\n    86\u2192        if (!snap.empty) setBroadcast({ id: snap.docs[0].id, ...snap.docs[0].data() });\n    87\u2192        else setBroadcast(null);\n    88\u2192      },\n    89\u2192      () => {}\n    90\u2192    );\n    91\u2192    return unsub;\n    92\u2192  }, []);\n    93\u2192\n    94\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    95\u2192    const onlineRef = ref(rtdb, \"online-users\");\n    96\u2192    const unsub = onValue(onlineRef, (snap) => {\n    97\u2192      const data = snap.val() || {};\n    98\u2192      setOnlineCount(Object.keys(data).filter(k => data[k] === true).length);\n    99\u2192    }, () => {});\n   100\u2192    const trendRef = ref(rtdb, \"trending\");\n   101\u2192    const trendUnsub = onValue(trendRef, (snap) => {\n   102\u2192      const data = snap.val() || {};\n   103\u2192      setTrending(Object.entries(data).map(([id, v]) => ({ id, ...v })).sort((a, b) => (b.score||0)-(a.score||0)).slice(0,10));\n   104\u2192    }, () => {});\n   105\u2192    const viewsRef = ref(rtdb, \"live-views\");\n   106\u2192    const viewsUnsub = onValue(viewsRef, (snap) => { setLiveViews(snap.val() || {}); }, () => {});\n   107\u2192    return () => { unsub(); trendUnsub(); viewsUnsub(); };\n   108\u2192  }, []);\n   109\u2192\n   110\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n   111\u2192    if (!user?.uid) return;\n   112\u2192    const userOnlineRef = ref(rtdb, `online-users/${user.uid}`);\n   113\u2192    rtdbSet(userOnlineRef, true).catch(() => {});\n   114\u2192    onDisconnect(userOnlineRef).set(null);\n   115\u2192    return () => { rtdbSet(userOnlineRef, null).catch(() => {}); };\n   116\u2192  }, [user?.uid]);\n   117\u2192\n   118\u2192  function trackReelView(reelId) {\n   119\u2192    if (!reelId || !user?.uid) return;\n   120\u2192    if (reelId.startsWith(\"ff\") || reelId.startsWith(\"dr\") || reelId.startsWith(\"du\") || reelId.startsWith(\"fu\")) return;\n   121\u2192    const viewRef = ref(rtdb, `live-views/${reelId}`);\n   122\u2192    rtdbSet(viewRef, (liveViews[reelId] || 0) + 1).catch(() => {});\n   123\u2192    const trendRef = ref(rtdb, `trending/${reelId}/score`);\n   124\u2192    rtdbSet(trendRef, ((trending.find(t => t.id === reelId)?.score) || 0) + 1).catch(() => {});\n   125\u2192  }\n   126\u2192\n   127\u2192  function likeReelLive(reelId) {\n   128\u2192    if (!reelId || !user?.uid) return;\n   129\u2192    const likeRef = ref(rtdb, `live-likes/${reelId}`);\n   130\u2192    rtdbSet(likeRef, Date.now()).catch(() => {});\n   131\u2192  }\n   132\u2192\n   133\u2192  async function loadUserLikes(uid) {\n   134\u2192    try {\n   135\u2192      const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \"userLikes\", uid));\n   136\u2192      if (snap.exists()) {\n   137\u2192        const liked = snap.data().liked || {};\n   138\u2192        setLikedReels(liked);\n   139\u2192        localStorage.setItem(`ax_liked_${uid}`, JSON.stringify(liked));\n   140\u2192      }\n   141\u2192    } catch {}\n   142\u2192  }\n   143\u2192\n   144\u2192  async function loadUserFollowing(uid) {\n   145\u2192    try {\n   146\u2192      const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowing\", uid));\n   147\u2192      if (snap.exists()) {\n   148\u2192        const f = snap.data().following || {};\n   149\u2192        setFollowing(f);\n   150\u2192        localStorage.setItem(`ax_following_${uid}`, JSON.stringify(f));\n   151\u2192      }\n   152\u2192    } catch {}\n   153\u2192  }\n   154\u2192\n   155\u2192  async function likeReel(reelId) {\n   156\u2192    if (!user?.uid) return;\n   157\u2192    const uid = user.uid;\n   158\u2192    const isLiked = !!likedReels[reelId];\n   159\u2192    setLikedReels(prev => {\n   160\u2192      const next = { ...prev };\n   161\u2192      if (isLiked) delete next[reelId]; else next[reelId] = true;\n   162\u2192      localStorage.setItem(`ax_liked_${uid}`, JSON.stringify(next));\n   163\u2192      return next;\n   164\u2192    });\n   165\u2192    try {\n   166\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"userLikes\", uid), { liked: { [reelId]: isLiked ? null : true } }, { merge: true });\n   167\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"reelMeta\", reelId), { likesCount: increment(isLiked ? -1 : 1) }, { merge: true });\n   168\u2192    } catch {}\n   169\u2192  }\n   170\u2192\n   171\u2192  async function followUser(targetId, targetName) {\n   172\u2192    if (!user?.uid || targetId === user.uid) return;\n   173\u2192    const uid = user.uid;\n   174\u2192    setFollowing(prev => {\n   175\u2192      const next = { ...prev, [targetId]: true };\n   176\u2192      localStorage.setItem(`ax_following_${uid}`, JSON.stringify(next));\n   177\u2192      return next;\n   178\u2192    });\n   179\u2192    try {\n   180\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowing\", uid), { following: { [targetId]: true } }, { merge: true });\n   181\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowers\", targetId), { followers: { [uid]: true } }, { merge: true });\n   182\u2192      await addDoc(collection(db, \"notifications\"), {\n   183\u2192        targetUid: targetId, actorUid: uid,\n   184\u2192        actorName: user.name || user.email, type: \"follow\",\n   185\u2192        message: `@${user.name || user.email} started following you`,\n   186\u2192        read: false, createdAt: serverTimestamp(),\n   187\u2192      });\n   188\u2192    } catch {}\n   189\u2192  }\n   190\u2192\n   191\u2192  async function unfollowUser(targetId) {\n   192\u2192    if (!user?.uid) return;\n   193\u2192    const uid = user.uid;\n   194\u2192    setFollowing(prev => {\n   195\u2192      const next = { ...prev }; delete next[targetId];\n   196\u2192      localStorage.setItem(`ax_following_${uid}`, JSON.stringify(next));\n   197\u2192      return next;\n   198\u2192    });\n   199\u2192    try {\n   200\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowing\", uid), { following: { [targetId]: null } }, { merge: true });\n   201\u2192      await setDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowers\", targetId), { followers: { [uid]: null } }, { merge: true });\n   202\u2192    } catch {}\n   203\u2192  }\n   204\u2192\n   205\u2192  async function markAllRead() {\n   206\u2192    if (!user?.uid || notifications.length === 0) return;\n   207\u2192    setUnreadCount(0);\n   208\u2192    setNotifications(prev => prev.map(n => ({ ...n, read: true })));\n   209\u2192    for (const n of notifications.filter(n => !n.read)) {\n   210\u2192      try { await updateDoc(doc(db, \"notifications\", n.id), { read: true }); } catch {}\n   211\u2192    }\n   212\u2192  }\n   213\u2192\n   214\u2192  async function sendBroadcast(message) {\n   215\u2192    try {\n   216\u2192      await addDoc(collection(db, \"adminBroadcasts\"), { message, active: true, createdAt: serverTimestamp() });\n   217\u2192    } catch {}\n   218\u2192  }\n   219\u2192\n   220\u2192  async function dismissBroadcast(id) {\n   221\u2192    try { await updateDoc(doc(db, \"adminBroadcasts\", id), { active: false }); } catch {}\n   222\u2192    setBroadcast(null);\n   223\u2192  }\n   224\u2192\n   225\u2192  async function submitAd(adData) {\n   226\u2192    if (!user?.uid) return false;\n   227\u2192    try {\n   228\u2192      await addDoc(collection(db, \"advertisements\"), {\n   229\u2192        ...adData, userId: user.uid, userName: user.name || user.email,\n   230\u2192        status: \"pending\", viewsCount: 0, createdAt: serverTimestamp(),\n   231\u2192      });\n   232\u2192      return true;\n   233\u2192    } catch { return false; }\n   234\u2192  }\n   235\u2192\n   236\u2192  return (\n   237\u2192    <SocialContext.Provider value={{\n   238\u2192      likedReels, likeReel,\n   239\u2192      following, followUser, unfollowUser,\n   240\u2192      notifications, unreadCount, markAllRead,\n   241\u2192      broadcast, dismissBroadcast, sendBroadcast, submitAd,\n   242\u2192      onlineCount, liveViews, trending, trackReelView, likeReelLive,\n   243\u2192      autoTickPopup, dismissAutoTickPopup,\n   244\u2192    }}>\n   245\u2192      {children}\n   246\u2192    </SocialContext.Provider>\n   247\u2192  );\n   248\u2192}\n   249\u2192\n   250\u2192export function useSocial() { return useContext(SocialContext); }"}]}]}
{"memory_id": 390, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now I have a clear picture. Let me implement the full professional upgrade \u2014 removing all demo data, fixing autoplay, adding Stories, Creator Dashboard, and real-only Firebase data. I'll write everything in parallel batches:"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [], "tool_calls": [{"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Search.jsx", "limit": 60}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "read", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx", "offset": 100, "limit": 146}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Search.jsx (lines 1-60 of 176)\n     1\u2192import { useState, useMemo, useEffect, useRef } from \"react\";\n     2\u2192import { Link, useLocation, useSearch } from \"wouter\";\n     3\u2192import { ALL_USERS } from \"../data/demoUsers\";\n     4\u2192import { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\n     5\u2192import { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\n     6\u2192import BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\n     7\u2192\n     8\u2192function fmtNum(n) {\n     9\u2192  if (!n) return \"0\";\n    10\u2192  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n    11\u2192  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n    12\u2192  return String(n);\n    13\u2192}\n    14\u2192\n    15\u2192function score(user, q) {\n    16\u2192  const lq = q.toLowerCase().trim().replace(/^@/, \"\");\n    17\u2192  const un = (user.username || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    18\u2192  const nm = (user.name || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    19\u2192  const ct = (user.country || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    20\u2192  const bi = (user.bio || \"\").toLowerCase();\n    21\u2192  let s = 0;\n    22\u2192  if (un === lq || nm === lq) s += 100;\n    23\u2192  if (un.startsWith(lq) || nm.startsWith(lq)) s += 80;\n    24\u2192  if (un.includes(lq)) s += 60;\n    25\u2192  if (nm.includes(lq)) s += 50;\n    26\u2192  if (ct.includes(lq)) s += 40;\n    27\u2192  if (bi.includes(lq)) s += 20;\n    28\u2192  return s;\n    29\u2192}\n    30\u2192\n    31\u2192const CATS = [\n    32\u2192  { label: \"All\", icon: \"\ud83c\udf0d\" },\n    33\u2192  { label: \"Mammals\", icon: \"\ud83e\udd81\" },\n    34\u2192  { label: \"Birds\", icon: \"\ud83e\udd85\" },\n    35\u2192  { label: \"Aquatic\", icon: \"\ud83d\udc2c\" },\n    36\u2192  { label: \"Reptiles\", icon: \"\ud83d\udc0d\" },\n    37\u2192  { label: \"Desert\", icon: \"\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f\" },\n    38\u2192  { label: \"Mountains\", icon: \"\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f\" },\n    39\u2192];\n    40\u2192\n    41\u2192export default function Search() {\n    42\u2192  const [query, setQuery] = useState(\"\");\n    43\u2192  const [catFilter, setCatFilter] = useState(\"All\");\n    44\u2192  const [sortBy, setSortBy] = useState(\"followers\");\n    45\u2192  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n    46\u2192  const searchStr = useSearch();\n    47\u2192  const { user } = useAuth();\n    48\u2192  const { following, followUser, unfollowUser } = useSocial();\n    49\u2192  const inputRef = useRef(null);\n    50\u2192\n    51\u2192  useEffect(() => {\n    52\u2192    inputRef.current?.focus();\n    53\u2192    const params = new URLSearchParams(searchStr);\n    54\u2192    const q = params.get(\"q\");\n    55\u2192    if (q) setQuery(q);\n    56\u2192  }, []);\n    57\u2192\n    58\u2192  const results = useMemo(() => {\n    59\u2192    let list = [...ALL_USERS];\n    60\u2192    if (catFilter !== \"All\") {"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx (lines 100-245 of 246)\n   100\u2192\n   101\u2192  if (loading) return (\n   102\u2192    <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n   103\u2192      <div className=\"user-profile-loading\"><div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div><p>Loading profile\u2026</p></div>\n   104\u2192    </div>\n   105\u2192  );\n   106\u2192\n   107\u2192  if (!profile) return (\n   108\u2192    <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n   109\u2192      <div className=\"not-found\">\n   110\u2192        <div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc64</div>\n   111\u2192        <h2>User not found</h2>\n   112\u2192        <Link href=\"/reels\" className=\"back-btn\">\u2190 Back to Reels</Link>\n   113\u2192      </div>\n   114\u2192    </div>\n   115\u2192  );\n   116\u2192\n   117\u2192  const isOwn = currentUser?.uid === profile.uid;\n   118\u2192  const canManageTick = isSuperAdmin && adminMode;\n   119\u2192\n   120\u2192  return (\n   121\u2192    <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n   122\u2192      {tickMsg && <div className=\"tick-msg-toast\">{tickMsg}</div>}\n   123\u2192\n   124\u2192      <div className=\"up-header\">\n   125\u2192        <button className=\"up-back-btn\" onClick={() => navigate(-1)}>\u2190 Back</button>\n   126\u2192        {canManageTick && (\n   127\u2192          <div className=\"admin-tick-controls\">\n   128\u2192            <span style={{ fontSize: \"0.72rem\", color: \"#a855f7\", fontWeight: 700 }}>ADMIN</span>\n   129\u2192            <button className=\"atick-btn give\" onClick={() => handleGiveTick(true)}>\u2713 Give Blue Tick</button>\n   130\u2192            <button className=\"atick-btn remove\" onClick={() => handleGiveTick(false)}>\u2715 Remove Tick</button>\n   131\u2192          </div>\n   132\u2192        )}\n   133\u2192      </div>\n   134\u2192\n   135\u2192      <div className=\"up-card\">\n   136\u2192        <div className=\"up-avatar-wrap\">\n   137\u2192          <div className=\"up-avatar\">{profile.avatar || (profile.name?.[0]?.toUpperCase() || \"U\")}</div>\n   138\u2192          {profile.isVerified && <div className=\"up-avatar-tick\"><BlueTick size={18} /></div>}\n   139\u2192        </div>\n   140\u2192        <div className=\"up-name\">\n   141\u2192          {profile.name || profile.username}\n   142\u2192          {profile.isVerified && <BlueTick size={20} />}\n   143\u2192        </div>\n   144\u2192        <div className=\"up-username\">@{profile.username || profile.email?.split(\"@\")[0]}</div>\n   145\u2192        {profile.bio && <p className=\"up-bio\">{profile.bio}</p>}\n   146\u2192        {profile.country && <div className=\"up-country\">\ud83d\udccd {profile.country}</div>}\n   147\u2192\n   148\u2192        <div className=\"up-stats\">\n   149\u2192          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"reels\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n   150\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmtNum(profile.reels || 0)}</div>\n   151\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Reels</div>\n   152\u2192          </div>\n   153\u2192          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"followers\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n   154\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmtNum(profile.followers || 0)}</div>\n   155\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Followers</div>\n   156\u2192          </div>\n   157\u2192          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"following\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n   158\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmtNum(profile.following || 0)}</div>\n   159\u2192            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Following</div>\n   160\u2192          </div>\n   161\u2192        </div>\n   162\u2192\n   163\u2192        {!isOwn && currentUser && (\n   164\u2192          <button\n   165\u2192            className={`up-follow-btn ${isFollowing ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n   166\u2192            onClick={() => isFollowing ? unfollowUser(userId) : followUser(userId, profile.username || profile.name)}\n   167\u2192          >\n   168\u2192            {isFollowing ? \"\u2713 Following\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n   169\u2192          </button>\n   170\u2192        )}\n   171\u2192        {isOwn && <Link href=\"/profile\" className=\"up-follow-btn\">\u270f\ufe0f Edit Profile</Link>}\n   172\u2192      </div>\n   173\u2192\n   174\u2192      {/* Tabs */}\n   175\u2192      <div className=\"up-tabs\">\n   176\u2192        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"reels\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"reels\")}>\ud83c\udfac Reels</button>\n   177\u2192        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"followers\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"followers\")}>\ud83d\udc65 Followers</button>\n   178\u2192        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"following\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"following\")}>\u2705 Following</button>\n   179\u2192      </div>\n   180\u2192\n   181\u2192      {/* Reels grid */}\n   182\u2192      {tab === \"reels\" && (\n   183\u2192        <div className=\"up-reels-grid\">\n   184\u2192          {userReels.length === 0 && <div className=\"up-empty\">No reels yet.</div>}\n   185\u2192          {userReels.map(r => (\n   186\u2192            <div key={r.id} className=\"up-reel-thumb\" style={{ background: r.bg }}>\n   187\u2192              {r.url\n   188\u2192                ? <video src={r.url} muted loop autoPlay playsInline className=\"up-reel-video\" />\n   189\u2192                : <div className=\"up-reel-emoji-inner\">{r.emoji}</div>\n   190\u2192              }\n   191\u2192              <div className=\"up-reel-overlay\">\n   192\u2192                <div className=\"up-reel-title\">{r.title}</div>\n   193\u2192                <div className=\"up-reel-likes\">\u2764\ufe0f {fmtNum(r.likes)}</div>\n   194\u2192              </div>\n   195\u2192            </div>\n   196\u2192          ))}\n   197\u2192        </div>\n   198\u2192      )}\n   199\u2192\n   200\u2192      {/* Followers list */}\n   201\u2192      {tab === \"followers\" && (\n   202\u2192        <UserList users={followersList} emptyMsg=\"No followers yet.\" following={following} currentUser={currentUser} followUser={followUser} unfollowUser={unfollowUser} />\n   203\u2192      )}\n   204\u2192\n   205\u2192      {/* Following list */}\n   206\u2192      {tab === \"following\" && (\n   207\u2192        <UserList users={followingList} emptyMsg=\"Not following anyone yet.\" following={following} currentUser={currentUser} followUser={followUser} unfollowUser={unfollowUser} />\n   208\u2192      )}\n   209\u2192    </div>\n   210\u2192  );\n   211\u2192}\n   212\u2192\n   213\u2192function UserList({ users, emptyMsg, following, currentUser, followUser, unfollowUser }) {\n   214\u2192  if (users.length === 0) return <div className=\"up-empty\">{emptyMsg}</div>;\n   215\u2192  return (\n   216\u2192    <div className=\"up-user-list\">\n   217\u2192      {users.map(u => {\n   218\u2192        const isFollowing = !!following[u.id];\n   219\u2192        const isOwn = currentUser?.uid === u.id;\n   220\u2192        return (\n   221\u2192          <div key={u.id} className=\"up-user-row\">\n   222\u2192            <Link href={`/user/${u.id}`} className=\"up-user-row-left\">\n   223\u2192              <div className=\"up-user-row-avatar\">{u.avatar || u.username?.[0]?.toUpperCase() || \"U\"}</div>\n   224\u2192              <div>\n   225\u2192                <div className=\"up-user-row-username\">\n   226\u2192                  @{u.username || u.id}\n   227\u2192                  {u.verified && <BlueTick size={13} />}\n   228\u2192                </div>\n   229\u2192                {u.name && <div className=\"up-user-row-name\">{u.name}</div>}\n   230\u2192              </div>\n   231\u2192            </Link>\n   232\u2192            {!isOwn && currentUser && (\n   233\u2192              <button\n   234\u2192                className={`up-mini-follow-btn ${isFollowing ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n   235\u2192                onClick={() => isFollowing ? unfollowUser(u.id) : followUser(u.id, u.username)}\n   236\u2192              >\n   237\u2192                {isFollowing ? \"\u2713\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n   238\u2192              </button>\n   239\u2192            )}\n   240\u2192          </div>\n   241\u2192        );\n   242\u2192      })}\n   243\u2192    </div>\n   244\u2192  );\n   245\u2192}"}]}]}
{"memory_id": 391, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now I have everything I need. Writing all files simultaneously in two parallel batches:"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [], "tool_calls": [{"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { useLocation, Link } from \"wouter\";\nimport {\n  collection, query, orderBy, limit, where,\n  onSnapshot, doc, getDoc, setDoc, updateDoc,\n  increment, serverTimestamp, addDoc, deleteDoc\n} from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\nimport { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\nimport BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\nimport CommentsPanel from \"../components/CommentsPanel\";\nimport UploadReel from \"../components/UploadReel\";\n\nfunction fmt(n) {\n  if (!n || n === 0) return \"0\";\n  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n  return String(n);\n}\n\nconst CATS = [\"All\",\"Mammals\",\"Birds\",\"Aquatic\",\"Reptiles\",\"Small Creatures\",\"Trees\",\"Mountains\",\"Sea\",\"Desert\"];\n\nfunction resolveUrl(path) {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  if (path.startsWith(\"data:\") || path.startsWith(\"http\")) return path;\n  return `/api/storage${path}`;\n}\n\nexport default function Reels() {\n  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n  const { user, adminMode, isSuperAdmin } = useAuth();\n  const { likedReels, likeReel, following, followUser, unfollowUser, trackReelView } = useSocial();\n\n  const [allReels, setAllReels] = useState([]);\n  const [feed, setFeed] = useState([]);\n  const [catFilter, setCatFilter] = useState(\"All\");\n  const [activeIdx, setActiveIdx] = useState(0);\n  const [muted, setMuted] = useState(true); // must start muted for autoplay to work\n  const [commentsReel, setCommentsReel] = useState(null);\n  const [uploadOpen, setUploadOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [heartAnims, setHeartAnims] = useState({});\n  const [savedReels, setSavedReels] = useState(() => {\n    try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"ax_saved_reels\") || \"{}\"); } catch { return {}; }\n  });\n  const [liveLikes, setLiveLikes] = useState({});\n  const [creatorCache, setCreatorCache] = useState({});\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  const scrollRef = useRef(null);\n  const videoRefs = useRef({});\n  const observerRef = useRef(null);\n  const lastTapRef = useRef({});\n  const uploadedRef = useRef(false);\n\n  // Load real reels from Firestore only\n  useEffect(() => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    const q = query(collection(db, \"reels\"), orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"), limit(100));\n    const unsub = onSnapshot(q, snap => {\n      const reels = snap.docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() }));\n      setAllReels(reels);\n      setLoading(false);\n    }, () => setLoading(false));\n    return unsub;\n  }, []);\n\n  // Build feed from real reels only\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const filtered = catFilter === \"All\"\n      ? allReels\n      : allReels.filter(r => r.category === catFilter);\n    setFeed(filtered);\n    setActiveIdx(0);\n    if (scrollRef.current) scrollRef.current.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \"instant\" });\n  }, [allReels, catFilter]);\n\n  // Fetch creator profiles for all reels in feed\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const missing = [...new Set(feed.map(r => r.userId).filter(id => id && !creatorCache[id]))];\n    if (missing.length === 0) return;\n    Promise.all(missing.map(async id => {\n      try {\n        const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \"users\", id));\n        return [id, snap.exists() ? snap.data() : {}];\n      } catch { return [id, {}]; }\n    })).then(pairs => {\n      const update = Object.fromEntries(pairs);\n      setCreatorCache(p => ({ ...p, ...update }));\n    });\n  }, [feed]);\n\n  // Intersection Observer for autoplay\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!scrollRef.current || feed.length === 0) return;\n    observerRef.current?.disconnect();\n\n    const obs = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio >= 0.6) {\n          const idx = Number(entry.target.dataset.idx);\n          setActiveIdx(idx);\n          const reel = feed[idx];\n          if (reel?.id) trackReelView(reel.id);\n\n          Object.entries(videoRefs.current).forEach(([vi, el]) => {\n            if (!el) return;\n            if (Number(vi) === idx) {\n              el.muted = muted;\n              const playPromise = el.play();\n              if (playPromise) playPromise.catch(() => {\n                el.muted = true;\n                el.play().catch(() => {});\n              });\n            } else {\n              el.pause();\n              el.currentTime = 0;\n            }\n          });\n        }\n      });\n    }, { threshold: 0.6, root: scrollRef.current });\n\n    const slides = scrollRef.current.querySelectorAll(\"[data-idx]\");\n    slides.forEach(s => obs.observe(s));\n    observerRef.current = obs;\n    return () => obs.disconnect();\n  }, [feed.length, muted]);\n\n  // Sync muted state to active video immediately\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const el = videoRefs.current[activeIdx];\n    if (el) {\n      el.muted = muted;\n      if (!muted) el.play().catch(() => { el.muted = true; setMuted(true); });\n    }\n  }, [muted, activeIdx]);\n\n  const triggerHeart = useCallback((id) => {\n    setHeartAnims(h => ({ ...h, [id]: true }));\n    setTimeout(() => setHeartAnims(h => ({ ...h, [id]: false })), 900);\n  }, []);\n\n  async function handleLike(reel) {\n    if (!user) { navigate(\"/auth\"); return; }\n    const already = !!likedReels[reel.id];\n    if (!already) triggerHeart(reel.id);\n    setLiveLikes(p => ({ ...p, [reel.id]: (p[reel.id] ?? reel.likes ?? 0) + (already ? -1 : 1) }));\n    await likeReel(reel.id, reel.likes || 0);\n  }\n\n  function handleDoubleTap(reel) {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const last = lastTapRef.current[reel.id] || 0;\n    if (now - last < 350) {\n      if (!likedReels[reel.id]) handleLike(reel);\n      triggerHeart(reel.id);\n    }\n    lastTapRef.current[reel.id] = now;\n  }\n\n  function handleSave(reelId) {\n    const next = { ...savedReels, [reelId]: !savedReels[reelId] };\n    if (!next[reelId]) delete next[reelId];\n    setSavedReels(next);\n    localStorage.setItem(\"ax_saved_reels\", JSON.stringify(next));\n  }\n\n  async function handleShare(reel) {\n    const text = `${reel.title} \u2014 Animal X Wildlife`;\n    if (navigator.share) {\n      try { await navigator.share({ title: reel.title, text, url: window.location.href }); return; } catch {}\n    }\n    try {\n      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href);\n      alert(\"Link copied!\");\n    } catch {}\n  }\n\n  async function handleDeleteReel(reelId) {\n    if (!window.confirm(\"Delete this reel permanently?\")) return;\n    try { await deleteDoc(doc(db, \"reels\", reelId)); } catch (e) { alert(e.message); }\n  }\n\n  function handleFollowToggle(targetUserId) {\n    if (!user) { navigate(\"/auth\"); return; }\n    if (following[targetUserId]) unfollowUser(targetUserId);\n    else followUser(targetUserId);\n  }\n\n  function toggleMute() {\n    setMuted(m => !m);\n  }\n\n  if (loading) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"reels-page\" style={{ display: \"flex\", alignItems: \"center\", justifyContent: \"center\", flexDirection: \"column\", gap: 16, color: \"var(--text2)\" }}>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\", animation: \"spin 1s linear infinite\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div>\n        <p>Loading wildlife reels\u2026</p>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"reels-page\">\n      {/* Top bar */}\n      <div className=\"reels-top-bar\">\n        <span className=\"reels-top-title\">\ud83c\udfac Wildlife Reels</span>\n        <div className=\"reels-top-actions\">\n          <button className=\"reels-mute-btn\" onClick={toggleMute} title={muted ? \"Unmute\" : \"Mute\"}>\n            {muted ? \"\ud83d\udd07\" : \"\ud83d\udd0a\"}\n          </button>\n          {user && (\n            <button className=\"reels-upload-btn\" onClick={() => setUploadOpen(true)}>\n              + Upload\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Category filter */}\n      <div className=\"reels-cat-bar\">\n        {CATS.map(c => (\n          <button\n            key={c}\n            className={`reel-cat-pill ${catFilter === c ? \"active\" : \"\"}`}\n            onClick={() => setCatFilter(c)}\n          >\n            {c}\n          </button>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Reels feed */}\n      <div className=\"reels-scroll\" ref={scrollRef}>\n        {feed.length === 0 ? (\n          <div className=\"reels-empty\">\n            <div style={{ fontSize: \"5rem\" }}>\ud83e\udd81</div>\n            <h3>No wildlife reels yet</h3>\n            <p>Be the first to upload a wildlife reel and inspire the community!</p>\n            {user ? (\n              <button className=\"btn-primary\" onClick={() => setUploadOpen(true)} style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>\n                \ud83c\udfac Upload Your First Reel\n              </button>\n            ) : (\n              <Link href=\"/auth\" className=\"btn-primary\" style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>\n                Login to Upload\n              </Link>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        ) : (\n          feed.map((reel, idx) => {\n            const liked = !!likedReels[reel.id];\n            const saved = !!savedReels[reel.id];\n            const likes = liveLikes[reel.id] ?? reel.likes ?? 0;\n            const isOwn = user?.uid === reel.userId;\n            const isAdmin = isSuperAdmin && adminMode;\n            const isFollowed = !!following[reel.userId];\n            const isActive = idx === activeIdx;\n            const creator = creatorCache[reel.userId] || {};\n            const creatorPhoto = resolveUrl(creator.photo || reel.userPhoto || null);\n            const creatorName = creator.name || reel.username || \"wildlife_creator\";\n            const creatorVerified = creator.manualVerified || reel.userVerified || false;\n            const creatorFollowers = creator.followers || reel.userFollowers || 0;\n            const videoUrl = resolveUrl(reel.videoUrl);\n            const thumbUrl = resolveUrl(reel.thumbnailUrl);\n\n            return (\n              <div\n                key={reel.id}\n                className={`reel-item ${isActive ? \"active\" : \"\"}`}\n                data-idx={idx}\n                onClick={() => handleDoubleTap(reel)}\n              >\n                {/* Video */}\n                {videoUrl ? (\n                  <video\n                    ref={el => { if (el) videoRefs.current[idx] = el; }}\n                    className=\"reel-video\"\n                    src={videoUrl}\n                    poster={thumbUrl || undefined}\n                    preload={idx <= activeIdx + 2 ? \"metadata\" : \"none\"}\n                    autoPlay={isActive}\n                    loop\n                    playsInline\n                    muted={muted}\n                  />\n                ) : (\n                  <div className=\"reel-demo-bg\" style={{ background: \"linear-gradient(135deg,#0a2818,#065f46,#0f4c2a)\" }}>\n                    <div className=\"reel-demo-emoji\">\ud83e\udd81</div>\n                  </div>\n                )}\n\n                {/* Heart animation on double tap */}\n                {heartAnims[reel.id] && <div className=\"reel-heart-burst\">\u2764\ufe0f</div>}\n\n                {/* Gradient overlay */}\n                <div className=\"reel-gradient-overlay\" />\n\n                {/* Bottom info */}\n                <div className=\"reel-overlay-bottom\">\n                  {/* Creator row */}\n                  <div className=\"reel-creator-row\">\n                    <Link href={`/user/${reel.userId}`} onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>\n                      <div className=\"reel-avatar-wrap\">\n                        {creatorPhoto\n                          ? <img src={creatorPhoto} alt={creatorName} className=\"reel-avatar-img\" />\n                          : <div className=\"reel-avatar-initials\">{creatorName[0]?.toUpperCase() || \"\ud83e\udd81\"}</div>\n                        }\n                      </div>\n                    </Link>\n                    <div className=\"reel-creator-info\">\n                      <Link href={`/user/${reel.userId}`} onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()} className=\"reel-username-link\">\n                        <span>@{creatorName}</span>\n                        {creatorVerified && <BlueTick size={14} />}\n                      </Link>\n                      {creatorFollowers > 0 && (\n                        <div className=\"reel-creator-followers\">{fmt(creatorFollowers)} followers</div>\n                      )}\n                    </div>\n                    {!isOwn && (\n                      <button\n                        className={`reel-follow-btn ${isFollowed ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n                        onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); handleFollowToggle(reel.userId); }}\n                      >\n                        {isFollowed ? \"\u2713 Following\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n                      </button>\n                    )}\n                  </div>\n\n                  {/* Title */}\n                  <div className=\"reel-title\">{reel.title}</div>\n                  {reel.desc && (\n                    <div className=\"reel-desc\">\n                      {reel.desc.length > 90 ? reel.desc.slice(0, 90) + \"\u2026\" : reel.desc}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n\n                  {/* Hashtags */}\n                  {reel.hashtags && (\n                    <div className=\"reel-hashtags\">\n                      {String(reel.hashtags).split(/[\\s,]+/).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 4).map(h => (\n                        <span key={h} className=\"reel-hashtag\">{h.startsWith(\"#\") ? h : \"#\" + h}</span>\n                      ))}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n\n                  {/* Meta row */}\n                  <div className=\"reel-meta-row\">\n                    <span>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f {fmt(reel.views || 0)}</span>\n                    {reel.location && <span>\ud83d\udccd {reel.location}</span>}\n                    {reel.category && <span className=\"reel-cat-badge\">{reel.category}</span>}\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Right-side action buttons */}\n                <div className=\"reel-actions-right\">\n                  {/* Like */}\n                  <button\n                    className={`reel-action-btn ${liked ? \"liked\" : \"\"}`}\n                    onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); handleLike(reel); }}\n                  >\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{liked ? \"\u2764\ufe0f\" : \"\ud83e\udd0d\"}</span>\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(likes)}</span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  {/* Comment */}\n                  <button\n                    className=\"reel-action-btn\"\n                    onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); setCommentsReel(reel); }}\n                  >\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\ud83d\udcac</span>\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(reel.comments || 0)}</span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  {/* Share */}\n                  <button\n                    className=\"reel-action-btn\"\n                    onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); handleShare(reel); }}\n                  >\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\u2197\ufe0f</span>\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{fmt(reel.shares || 0)}</span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  {/* Save */}\n                  <button\n                    className={`reel-action-btn ${saved ? \"saved\" : \"\"}`}\n                    onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); handleSave(reel.id); }}\n                  >\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{saved ? \"\ud83d\udd16\" : \"\ud83d\udccc\"}</span>\n                    <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{saved ? \"Saved\" : \"Save\"}</span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  {/* Mute toggle */}\n                  {videoUrl && (\n                    <button\n                      className=\"reel-action-btn\"\n                      onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); toggleMute(); }}\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">{muted ? \"\ud83d\udd07\" : \"\ud83d\udd0a\"}</span>\n                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">{muted ? \"Muted\" : \"Sound\"}</span>\n                    </button>\n                  )}\n\n                  {/* Delete (own or admin) */}\n                  {(isOwn || isAdmin) && (\n                    <button\n                      className=\"reel-action-btn danger-btn\"\n                      onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); handleDeleteReel(reel.id); }}\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"reel-action-icon\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f</span>\n                      <span className=\"reel-action-count\">Delete</span>\n                    </button>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Active indicator */}\n                {isActive && videoUrl && muted && (\n                  <button\n                    className=\"reel-unmute-hint\"\n                    onClick={e => { e.stopPropagation(); setMuted(false); }}\n                  >\n                    \ud83d\udd07 Tap for sound\n                  </button>\n                )}\n              </div>\n            );\n          })\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Comments panel */}\n      {commentsReel && (\n        <CommentsPanel reel={commentsReel} onClose={() => setCommentsReel(null)} />\n      )}\n\n      {/* Upload modal */}\n      {uploadOpen && (\n        <UploadReel\n          onClose={() => setUploadOpen(false)}\n          onUploaded={() => { setUploadOpen(false); uploadedRef.current = true; }}\n        />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport { useParams, Link, useLocation } from \"wouter\";\nimport {\n  doc, getDoc, setDoc, collection, query,\n  where, orderBy, getDocs, limit\n} from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\nimport { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\nimport BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\n\nfunction fmt(n) {\n  if (!n) return \"0\";\n  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n  return String(n);\n}\n\nfunction resolveUrl(path) {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  if (path.startsWith(\"data:\") || path.startsWith(\"http\")) return path;\n  return `/api/storage${path}`;\n}\n\nexport default function UserProfile() {\n  const { userId } = useParams();\n  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n  const { user: currentUser, isSuperAdmin, adminMode } = useAuth();\n  const { following, followUser, unfollowUser } = useSocial();\n\n  const [profile, setProfile] = useState(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [userReels, setUserReels] = useState([]);\n  const [reelsLoading, setReelsLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [tab, setTab] = useState(\"reels\");\n  const [followersList, setFollowersList] = useState([]);\n  const [followingList, setFollowingList] = useState([]);\n  const [listsLoading, setListsLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [tickMsg, setTickMsg] = useState(null);\n  const [totalLikes, setTotalLikes] = useState(0);\n\n  const isFollowing = !!following[userId];\n  const isOwn = currentUser?.uid === userId;\n  const canManageTick = isSuperAdmin && adminMode;\n\n  // Load profile from Firestore\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!userId) return;\n    setLoading(true);\n    setReelsLoading(true);\n\n    // Load profile\n    getDoc(doc(db, \"users\", userId)).then(snap => {\n      if (snap.exists()) {\n        setProfile({ uid: userId, ...snap.data() });\n      } else {\n        setProfile(null);\n      }\n      setLoading(false);\n    }).catch(() => { setProfile(null); setLoading(false); });\n\n    // Load user's reels from Firestore\n    const reelsQ = query(\n      collection(db, \"reels\"),\n      where(\"userId\", \"==\", userId),\n      orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"),\n      limit(50)\n    );\n    getDocs(reelsQ).then(snap => {\n      const reels = snap.docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() }));\n      setUserReels(reels);\n      // Compute total likes\n      const tl = reels.reduce((sum, r) => sum + (r.likes || 0), 0);\n      setTotalLikes(tl);\n      setReelsLoading(false);\n    }).catch(() => { setUserReels([]); setReelsLoading(false); });\n  }, [userId]);\n\n  // Load followers/following when tab changes\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (tab !== \"followers\" && tab !== \"following\") return;\n    if (followersList.length > 0 || followingList.length > 0) return;\n    setListsLoading(true);\n\n    Promise.all([\n      getDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowers\", userId)),\n      getDoc(doc(db, \"userFollowing\", userId)),\n    ]).then(async ([fSnap, fgSnap]) => {\n      const followerIds = Object.keys(fSnap.data()?.followers || {}).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 50);\n      const followingIds = Object.keys(fgSnap.data()?.following || {}).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 50);\n\n      // Resolve user profiles for these IDs\n      const resolveUsers = async (ids) => {\n        const results = await Promise.all(ids.map(async id => {\n          try {\n            const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \"users\", id));\n            return snap.exists() ? { id, uid: id, ...snap.data() } : { id, uid: id, name: id };\n          } catch { return { id, uid: id, name: id }; }\n        }));\n        return results;\n      };\n\n      const [fl, fgl] = await Promise.all([resolveUsers(followerIds), resolveUsers(followingIds)]);\n      setFollowersList(fl);\n      setFollowingList(fgl);\n      setListsLoading(false);\n    }).catch(() => setListsLoading(false));\n  }, [tab, userId]);\n\n  async function handleGiveTick(give) {\n    try {\n      await setDoc(doc(db, \"users\", userId), { manualVerified: give }, { merge: true });\n      setProfile(p => ({ ...p, manualVerified: give, isVerified: give }));\n      setTickMsg(give ? \"\u2705 Blue tick granted!\" : \"\u274c Blue tick removed!\");\n      setTimeout(() => setTickMsg(null), 3000);\n    } catch (e) { alert(\"Error: \" + e.message); }\n  }\n\n  if (loading) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n        <div className=\"user-profile-loading\">\n          <div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div>\n          <p>Loading profile\u2026</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (!profile) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n        <div className=\"not-found\">\n          <div style={{ fontSize: \"4rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc64</div>\n          <h2>User not found</h2>\n          <p style={{ color: \"var(--text2)\", marginTop: 8 }}>This profile doesn't exist or has been removed.</p>\n          <button onClick={() => navigate(-1)} className=\"btn-primary\" style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>\u2190 Go Back</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  const displayName = profile.name || profile.username || profile.email?.split(\"@\")[0] || \"Wildlife Creator\";\n  const username = profile.username || profile.email?.split(\"@\")[0] || profile.uid?.slice(0, 8);\n  const isVerified = profile.manualVerified || profile.isVerified || false;\n  const photoUrl = resolveUrl(profile.photo || profile.avatar || null);\n  const coverUrl = resolveUrl(profile.cover || null);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"user-profile-page\">\n      {tickMsg && <div className=\"tick-msg-toast\">{tickMsg}</div>}\n\n      {/* Header bar */}\n      <div className=\"up-header\">\n        <button className=\"up-back-btn\" onClick={() => navigate(-1)}>\u2190 Back</button>\n        {canManageTick && (\n          <div className=\"admin-tick-controls\">\n            <span className=\"admin-label\">ADMIN</span>\n            <button className=\"atick-btn give\" onClick={() => handleGiveTick(true)}>\u2713 Give Blue Tick</button>\n            <button className=\"atick-btn remove\" onClick={() => handleGiveTick(false)}>\u2715 Remove Tick</button>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Cover image */}\n      <div\n        className=\"up-cover\"\n        style={coverUrl ? { backgroundImage: `url(${coverUrl})` } : undefined}\n      />\n\n      {/* Profile card */}\n      <div className=\"up-card\">\n        <div className=\"up-avatar-wrap\">\n          {photoUrl\n            ? <img src={photoUrl} alt={displayName} className=\"up-avatar-img\" />\n            : <div className=\"up-avatar-initials\">{displayName[0]?.toUpperCase() || \"\ud83e\udd81\"}</div>\n          }\n          {isVerified && (\n            <div className=\"up-avatar-tick\"><BlueTick size={18} /></div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"up-name\">\n          {displayName}\n          {isVerified && <BlueTick size={20} />}\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"up-username\">@{username}</div>\n        {profile.bio && <p className=\"up-bio\">{profile.bio}</p>}\n        {profile.country && <div className=\"up-country\">\ud83d\udccd {profile.country}</div>}\n\n        {/* Stats */}\n        <div className=\"up-stats\">\n          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"reels\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmt(userReels.length || profile.reels || 0)}</div>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Reels</div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"followers\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmt(profile.followers || 0)}</div>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Followers</div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"up-stat\" onClick={() => setTab(\"following\")} style={{ cursor: \"pointer\" }}>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmt(profile.following || 0)}</div>\n            <div className=\"up-stat-label\">Following</div>\n          </div>\n          {totalLikes > 0 && (\n            <div className=\"up-stat\">\n              <div className=\"up-stat-val\">{fmt(totalLikes)}</div>\n              <div className=\"up-stat-label\">\u2764\ufe0f Likes</div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Follow / Edit buttons */}\n        {!isOwn && currentUser && (\n          <button\n            className={`up-follow-btn ${isFollowing ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n            onClick={() => isFollowing ? unfollowUser(userId) : followUser(userId, username)}\n          >\n            {isFollowing ? \"\u2713 Following\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n          </button>\n        )}\n        {isOwn && (\n          <Link href=\"/profile\" className=\"up-follow-btn\">\u270f\ufe0f Edit Profile</Link>\n        )}\n        {!currentUser && (\n          <Link href=\"/auth\" className=\"up-follow-btn\">+ Follow</Link>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Tabs */}\n      <div className=\"up-tabs\">\n        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"reels\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"reels\")}>\n          \ud83c\udfac Reels {userReels.length > 0 && `(${userReels.length})`}\n        </button>\n        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"followers\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"followers\")}>\n          \ud83d\udc65 Followers\n        </button>\n        <button className={`up-tab ${tab === \"following\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"following\")}>\n          \u2705 Following\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Reels grid */}\n      {tab === \"reels\" && (\n        <div className=\"up-reels-grid\">\n          {reelsLoading ? (\n            <div className=\"up-empty\">\n              <div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div>\n              <p>Loading reels\u2026</p>\n            </div>\n          ) : userReels.length === 0 ? (\n            <div className=\"up-empty\">\n              <div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\" }}>\ud83c\udfac</div>\n              <p>No wildlife reels uploaded yet.</p>\n              {isOwn && (\n                <Link href=\"/reels\" className=\"btn-primary\" style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>\n                  Upload Your First Reel\n                </Link>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          ) : (\n            userReels.map(r => {\n              const videoUrl = resolveUrl(r.videoUrl);\n              const thumbUrl = resolveUrl(r.thumbnailUrl);\n              return (\n                <div key={r.id} className=\"up-reel-thumb\">\n                  {videoUrl ? (\n                    thumbUrl\n                      ? <img src={thumbUrl} alt={r.title} className=\"up-reel-img\" />\n                      : (\n                        <video\n                          src={videoUrl}\n                          muted\n                          loop\n                          playsInline\n                          preload=\"metadata\"\n                          className=\"up-reel-video\"\n                        />\n                      )\n                  ) : (\n                    <div className=\"up-reel-placeholder\">\ud83e\udd81</div>\n                  )}\n                  <div className=\"up-reel-overlay\">\n                    <div className=\"up-reel-title\">{r.title}</div>\n                    <div className=\"up-reel-likes\">\u2764\ufe0f {fmt(r.likes || 0)}</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              );\n            })\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Followers list */}\n      {tab === \"followers\" && (\n        listsLoading ? (\n          <div className=\"up-empty\"><div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div><p>Loading\u2026</p></div>\n        ) : (\n          <UserList\n            users={followersList}\n            emptyMsg=\"No followers yet.\"\n            following={following}\n            currentUser={currentUser}\n            followUser={followUser}\n            unfollowUser={unfollowUser}\n          />\n        )\n      )}\n\n      {/* Following list */}\n      {tab === \"following\" && (\n        listsLoading ? (\n          <div className=\"up-empty\"><div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc3e</div><p>Loading\u2026</p></div>\n        ) : (\n          <UserList\n            users={followingList}\n            emptyMsg=\"Not following anyone yet.\"\n            following={following}\n            currentUser={currentUser}\n            followUser={followUser}\n            unfollowUser={unfollowUser}\n          />\n        )\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction UserList({ users, emptyMsg, following, currentUser, followUser, unfollowUser }) {\n  if (users.length === 0) return (\n    <div className=\"up-empty\"><div style={{ fontSize: \"2.5rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc65</div><p>{emptyMsg}</p></div>\n  );\n  return (\n    <div className=\"up-user-list\">\n      {users.map(u => {\n        const isFollowingU = !!following[u.id || u.uid];\n        const isOwn = currentUser?.uid === (u.id || u.uid);\n        const photoUrl = u.photo ? (u.photo.startsWith(\"/api\") || u.photo.startsWith(\"http\") ? u.photo : `/api/storage${u.photo}`) : null;\n        return (\n          <div key={u.id || u.uid} className=\"up-user-row\">\n            <Link href={`/user/${u.id || u.uid}`} className=\"up-user-row-left\">\n              {photoUrl\n                ? <img src={photoUrl} alt={u.name} className=\"up-user-row-avatar-img\" />\n                : <div className=\"up-user-row-avatar\">{(u.name || u.username || \"U\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>\n              }\n              <div>\n                <div className=\"up-user-row-username\">\n                  @{u.username || u.name || u.uid?.slice(0, 8)}\n                  {(u.manualVerified || u.verified) && <BlueTick size={13} />}\n                </div>\n                {u.name && <div className=\"up-user-row-name\">{u.name}</div>}\n                {u.country && <div className=\"up-user-row-country\">\ud83d\udccd {u.country}</div>}\n              </div>\n            </Link>\n            {!isOwn && currentUser && (\n              <button\n                className={`up-mini-follow-btn ${isFollowingU ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n                onClick={() => isFollowingU ? unfollowUser(u.id || u.uid) : followUser(u.id || u.uid, u.username || u.name)}\n              >\n                {isFollowingU ? \"\u2713\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n              </button>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        );\n      })}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Search.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { Link, useLocation, useSearch } from \"wouter\";\nimport {\n  collection, query, orderBy, limit, where,\n  getDocs, startAt, endAt\n} from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\nimport { useSocial } from \"../context/SocialContext\";\nimport BlueTick from \"../components/BlueTick\";\n\nfunction fmt(n) {\n  if (!n) return \"0\";\n  if (n >= 1000000) return (n / 1000000).toFixed(1) + \"M\";\n  if (n >= 1000) return (n / 1000).toFixed(1) + \"K\";\n  return String(n);\n}\n\nfunction resolveUrl(path) {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  if (path.startsWith(\"data:\") || path.startsWith(\"http\")) return path;\n  return `/api/storage${path}`;\n}\n\nconst CATS = [\"All\",\"Mammals\",\"Birds\",\"Aquatic\",\"Reptiles\",\"Small Creatures\",\"Mountains\",\"Sea\",\"Desert\"];\n\nexport default function Search() {\n  const [q, setQ] = useState(\"\");\n  const [tab, setTab] = useState(\"users\"); // users | reels | hashtags\n  const [catFilter, setCatFilter] = useState(\"All\");\n  const [users, setUsers] = useState([]);\n  const [reels, setReels] = useState([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [searched, setSearched] = useState(false);\n  const [, navigate] = useLocation();\n  const searchStr = useSearch();\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n  const { following, followUser, unfollowUser } = useSocial();\n  const inputRef = useRef(null);\n  const debounceRef = useRef(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    inputRef.current?.focus();\n    const params = new URLSearchParams(searchStr);\n    const qParam = params.get(\"q\");\n    if (qParam) {\n      setQ(qParam);\n      runSearch(qParam);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  const runSearch = useCallback(async (searchQ) => {\n    const trimmed = (searchQ || q).trim().replace(/^@/, \"\").toLowerCase();\n    if (!trimmed) return;\n    setLoading(true);\n    setSearched(true);\n\n    try {\n      // Search users by email prefix, name, or username\n      const [byName, byEmail] = await Promise.all([\n        getDocs(query(\n          collection(db, \"users\"),\n          orderBy(\"name\"),\n          startAt(trimmed),\n          endAt(trimmed + \"\\uf8ff\"),\n          limit(20)\n        )).catch(() => ({ docs: [] })),\n        getDocs(query(\n          collection(db, \"users\"),\n          orderBy(\"email\"),\n          startAt(trimmed),\n          endAt(trimmed + \"\\uf8ff\"),\n          limit(20)\n        )).catch(() => ({ docs: [] })),\n      ]);\n\n      const seen = new Set();\n      const userResults = [];\n      [...byName.docs, ...byEmail.docs].forEach(d => {\n        if (!seen.has(d.id)) {\n          seen.add(d.id);\n          userResults.push({ uid: d.id, ...d.data() });\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Also search all users and filter client-side for username/bio matches\n      const allUsersSnap = await getDocs(query(collection(db, \"users\"), limit(200)));\n      allUsersSnap.docs.forEach(d => {\n        if (!seen.has(d.id)) {\n          const data = d.data();\n          const match = [data.name, data.username, data.email, data.bio, data.country]\n            .filter(Boolean).join(\" \").toLowerCase();\n          if (match.includes(trimmed)) {\n            seen.add(d.id);\n            userResults.push({ uid: d.id, ...data });\n          }\n        }\n      });\n\n      setUsers(userResults);\n\n      // Search reels by title, hashtags, or category\n      const reelsSnap = await getDocs(query(\n        collection(db, \"reels\"),\n        orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"),\n        limit(200)\n      ));\n      const reelResults = reelsSnap.docs\n        .map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() }))\n        .filter(r => {\n          const text = [r.title, r.desc, r.hashtags, r.category, r.location]\n            .filter(Boolean).join(\" \").toLowerCase();\n          const catMatch = catFilter === \"All\" || r.category === catFilter;\n          return text.includes(trimmed) && catMatch;\n        });\n      setReels(reelResults);\n    } catch {}\n\n    setLoading(false);\n  }, [q, catFilter]);\n\n  function handleInput(val) {\n    setQ(val);\n    if (debounceRef.current) clearTimeout(debounceRef.current);\n    if (val.trim().length >= 2) {\n      debounceRef.current = setTimeout(() => runSearch(val), 400);\n    } else {\n      setUsers([]); setReels([]); setSearched(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function handleSubmit(e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    if (debounceRef.current) clearTimeout(debounceRef.current);\n    runSearch(q);\n  }\n\n  // Filter reels by category\n  const filteredReels = catFilter === \"All\" ? reels : reels.filter(r => r.category === catFilter);\n\n  // Extract hashtags from reels\n  const hashtagMap = {};\n  reels.forEach(r => {\n    if (!r.hashtags) return;\n    String(r.hashtags).split(/[\\s,]+/).filter(h => h.startsWith(\"#\")).forEach(h => {\n      hashtagMap[h] = (hashtagMap[h] || 0) + 1;\n    });\n  });\n  const hashtags = Object.entries(hashtagMap).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1]).slice(0, 20);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"search-page\">\n      {/* Search bar */}\n      <form className=\"search-bar-wrap\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n        <div className=\"search-bar\">\n          <span className=\"search-bar-icon\">\ud83d\udd0d</span>\n          <input\n            ref={inputRef}\n            className=\"search-bar-input\"\n            type=\"search\"\n            value={q}\n            onChange={e => handleInput(e.target.value)}\n            placeholder=\"Search users, reels, #hashtags\u2026\"\n            autoComplete=\"off\"\n          />\n          {q && (\n            <button type=\"button\" className=\"search-clear-btn\" onClick={() => { setQ(\"\"); setUsers([]); setReels([]); setSearched(false); }}>\u2715</button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"search-submit-btn\">Search</button>\n      </form>\n\n      {/* Tabs */}\n      {searched && (\n        <div className=\"search-tabs\">\n          <button className={`search-tab ${tab === \"users\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"users\")}>\n            \ud83d\udc65 Users {users.length > 0 && `(${users.length})`}\n          </button>\n          <button className={`search-tab ${tab === \"reels\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"reels\")}>\n            \ud83c\udfac Reels {filteredReels.length > 0 && `(${filteredReels.length})`}\n          </button>\n          <button className={`search-tab ${tab === \"hashtags\" ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} onClick={() => setTab(\"hashtags\")}>\n            # Hashtags {hashtags.length > 0 && `(${hashtags.length})`}\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Category filter (for reels tab) */}\n      {searched && tab === \"reels\" && (\n        <div className=\"search-cat-row\">\n          {CATS.map(c => (\n            <button\n              key={c}\n              className={`search-cat-pill ${catFilter === c ? \"active\" : \"\"}`}\n              onClick={() => setCatFilter(c)}\n            >\n              {c}\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Loading */}\n      {loading && (\n        <div className=\"search-loading\">\n          <div style={{ fontSize: \"2.5rem\" }}>\ud83d\udd0d</div>\n          <p>Searching\u2026</p>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Empty state (not searched yet) */}\n      {!loading && !searched && (\n        <div className=\"search-discovery\">\n          <div className=\"search-discovery-title\">\ud83c\udf0d Discover Wildlife</div>\n          <div className=\"search-discovery-tip\">Search for creators, reels, and wildlife hashtags</div>\n          <div className=\"search-discovery-grid\">\n            {[\"\ud83e\udd81 Lion\", \"\ud83d\udc18 Elephant\", \"\ud83e\udd85 Eagle\", \"\ud83d\udc2c Dolphin\", \"\ud83e\udd81 Wildlife\", \"\ud83c\udf3f Conservation\"].map(s => (\n              <button\n                key={s}\n                className=\"search-quick-pill\"\n                onClick={() => { const q2 = s.split(\" \").slice(1).join(\" \"); setQ(q2); runSearch(q2); }}\n              >\n                {s}\n              </button>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* No results */}\n      {!loading && searched && users.length === 0 && reels.length === 0 && (\n        <div className=\"search-no-results\">\n          <div style={{ fontSize: \"3rem\" }}>\ud83d\udd0d</div>\n          <h3>No results for \"{q}\"</h3>\n          <p>Try a different keyword, username, or hashtag</p>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Users tab */}\n      {!loading && searched && tab === \"users\" && (\n        <div className=\"search-results\">\n          {users.length === 0 ? (\n            <div className=\"search-no-results\">\n              <div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83d\udc64</div>\n              <p>No users found for \"{q}\"</p>\n            </div>\n          ) : (\n            users.map(u => {\n              const isFollowingU = !!following[u.uid];\n              const isOwn = currentUser?.uid === u.uid;\n              const photoUrl = resolveUrl(u.photo || u.avatar || null);\n              const isVerified = u.manualVerified || u.verified || false;\n              return (\n                <div key={u.uid} className=\"search-user-card\">\n                  <Link href={`/user/${u.uid}`} className=\"search-user-left\">\n                    {photoUrl\n                      ? <img src={photoUrl} alt={u.name} className=\"search-user-avatar-img\" />\n                      : <div className=\"search-user-avatar\">{(u.name || u.email || \"U\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>\n                    }\n                    <div className=\"search-user-info\">\n                      <div className=\"search-user-name\">\n                        {u.name || u.email?.split(\"@\")[0]}\n                        {isVerified && <BlueTick size={14} />}\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"search-user-handle\">\n                        @{u.username || u.email?.split(\"@\")[0]}\n                      </div>\n                      {u.country && <div className=\"search-user-country\">\ud83d\udccd {u.country}</div>}\n                      <div className=\"search-user-meta\">\n                        {u.followers > 0 && <span>\ud83d\udc65 {fmt(u.followers)}</span>}\n                        {(u.reels || 0) > 0 && <span>\ud83c\udfac {fmt(u.reels)} reels</span>}\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </Link>\n                  {!isOwn && user && (\n                    <button\n                      className={`search-follow-btn ${isFollowingU ? \"following\" : \"\"}`}\n                      onClick={() => isFollowingU ? unfollowUser(u.uid) : followUser(u.uid, u.username || u.name)}\n                    >\n                      {isFollowingU ? \"\u2713\" : \"+ Follow\"}\n                    </button>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n              );\n            })\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Reels tab */}\n      {!loading && searched && tab === \"reels\" && (\n        <div className=\"search-reels-grid\">\n          {filteredReels.length === 0 ? (\n            <div className=\"search-no-results\">\n              <div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83c\udfac</div>\n              <p>No reels found for \"{q}\"</p>\n            </div>\n          ) : (\n            filteredReels.map(r => {\n              const videoUrl = resolveUrl(r.videoUrl);\n              const thumbUrl = resolveUrl(r.thumbnailUrl);\n              return (\n                <Link key={r.id} href={`/reels`} className=\"search-reel-thumb\">\n                  {thumbUrl\n                    ? <img src={thumbUrl} alt={r.title} className=\"search-reel-img\" />\n                    : videoUrl\n                      ? <video src={videoUrl} muted playsInline preload=\"metadata\" className=\"search-reel-img\" />\n                      : <div className=\"search-reel-placeholder\">\ud83e\udd81</div>\n                  }\n                  <div className=\"search-reel-overlay\">\n                    <div className=\"search-reel-title\">{r.title}</div>\n                    <div className=\"search-reel-meta\">\n                      \u2764\ufe0f {fmt(r.likes || 0)} \u00b7 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f {fmt(r.views || 0)}\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </Link>\n              );\n            })\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Hashtags tab */}\n      {!loading && searched && tab === \"hashtags\" && (\n        <div className=\"search-hashtags\">\n          {hashtags.length === 0 ? (\n            <div className=\"search-no-results\">\n              <div style={{ fontSize: \"2rem\" }}>\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f</div>\n              <p>No hashtags found for \"{q}\"</p>\n            </div>\n          ) : (\n            hashtags.map(([tag, count]) => (\n              <button\n                key={tag}\n                className=\"search-hashtag-row\"\n                onClick={() => { setQ(tag); setTab(\"reels\"); runSearch(tag); }}\n              >\n                <span className=\"search-hashtag-tag\">{tag}</span>\n                <span className=\"search-hashtag-count\">{count} reel{count !== 1 ? \"s\" : \"\"}</span>\n              </button>\n            ))\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/components/StoriesRow.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\nimport {\n  collection, query, where, orderBy, onSnapshot, addDoc, serverTimestamp, limit\n} from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\nimport StoriesViewer from \"./StoriesViewer\";\nimport UploadStory from \"./UploadStory\";\n\nfunction resolveUrl(path) {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  if (path.startsWith(\"data:\") || path.startsWith(\"http\")) return path;\n  return `/api/storage${path}`;\n}\n\nexport default function StoriesRow() {\n  const { user, profile } = useAuth();\n  const [stories, setStories] = useState([]);\n  const [viewerOpen, setViewerOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [viewerStartUser, setViewerStartUser] = useState(null);\n  const [uploadOpen, setUploadOpen] = useState(false);\n  const now = Date.now();\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Load stories that haven't expired (expiresAt > now)\n    // We filter client-side since Firestore doesn't support > on milliseconds easily\n    const q = query(\n      collection(db, \"stories\"),\n      orderBy(\"createdAt\", \"desc\"),\n      limit(50)\n    );\n    const unsub = onSnapshot(q, snap => {\n      const all = snap.docs\n        .map(d => ({ id: d.id, ...d.data() }))\n        .filter(s => (s.expiresAt || 0) > Date.now());\n      setStories(all);\n    }, () => {});\n    return unsub;\n  }, []);\n\n  // Group stories by userId\n  const storyUsers = {};\n  stories.forEach(s => {\n    if (!storyUsers[s.userId]) storyUsers[s.userId] = { userId: s.userId, username: s.username, userPhoto: s.userPhoto, userVerified: s.userVerified, stories: [] };\n    storyUsers[s.userId].stories.push(s);\n  });\n\n  const storyUserList = Object.values(storyUsers);\n\n  // Check if current user has a story\n  const myStories = user ? (storyUsers[user.uid]?.stories || []) : [];\n  const hasMyStory = myStories.length > 0;\n\n  function openViewer(userId) {\n    setViewerStartUser(userId);\n    setViewerOpen(true);\n  }\n\n  if (!user && storyUserList.length === 0) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <div className=\"stories-row\">\n        {/* Add Story button for logged-in user */}\n        {user && (\n          <div className=\"story-bubble-wrap\" onClick={() => hasMyStory ? openViewer(user.uid) : setUploadOpen(true)}>\n            <div className={`story-bubble ${hasMyStory ? \"has-story\" : \"add-story\"}`}>\n              {hasMyStory ? (\n                (() => {\n                  const photoUrl = resolveUrl(profile?.photo || null);\n                  return photoUrl\n                    ? <img src={photoUrl} alt=\"My story\" className=\"story-bubble-img\" />\n                    : <div className=\"story-bubble-initial\">{(profile?.name || user.email || \"U\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>;\n                })()\n              ) : (\n                <div className=\"story-add-icon\">+</div>\n              )}\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"story-bubble-name\">\n              {hasMyStory ? \"Your Story\" : \"Add Story\"}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Other users' stories */}\n        {storyUserList\n          .filter(su => !user || su.userId !== user.uid)\n          .map(su => {\n            const photoUrl = resolveUrl(su.userPhoto || null);\n            const viewed = su.stories.every(s => s.viewerIds?.includes(user?.uid));\n            return (\n              <div key={su.userId} className=\"story-bubble-wrap\" onClick={() => openViewer(su.userId)}>\n                <div className={`story-bubble has-story ${viewed ? \"viewed\" : \"\"}`}>\n                  {photoUrl\n                    ? <img src={photoUrl} alt={su.username} className=\"story-bubble-img\" />\n                    : <div className=\"story-bubble-initial\">{(su.username || \"W\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>\n                  }\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"story-bubble-name\">@{su.username || \"user\"}</div>\n              </div>\n            );\n          })}\n      </div>\n\n      {viewerOpen && (\n        <StoriesViewer\n          storyUsers={storyUserList}\n          myUserId={user?.uid}\n          startUserId={viewerStartUser}\n          onClose={() => setViewerOpen(false)}\n        />\n      )}\n\n      {uploadOpen && (\n        <UploadStory\n          onClose={() => setUploadOpen(false)}\n          onUploaded={() => setUploadOpen(false)}\n        />\n      )}\n    </>\n  );\n}\n"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/components/StoriesViewer.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport { doc, updateDoc, arrayUnion, increment } from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\nimport BlueTick from \"./BlueTick\";\n\nconst STORY_DURATION = 5000; // 5 seconds per story\n\nfunction resolveUrl(path) {\n  if (!path) return null;\n  if (path.startsWith(\"data:\") || path.startsWith(\"http\")) return path;\n  return `/api/storage${path}`;\n}\n\nfunction timeAgo(ts) {\n  if (!ts) return \"\";\n  const ms = ts?.toDate ? ts.toDate().getTime() : ts;\n  const diff = (Date.now() - ms) / 1000;\n  if (diff < 60) return \"just now\";\n  if (diff < 3600) return Math.floor(diff / 60) + \"m ago\";\n  if (diff < 86400) return Math.floor(diff / 3600) + \"h ago\";\n  return Math.floor(diff / 86400) + \"d ago\";\n}\n\nexport default function StoriesViewer({ storyUsers, myUserId, startUserId, onClose }) {\n  const { user } = useAuth();\n\n  // Build ordered list starting from startUserId\n  const orderedUsers = (() => {\n    const idx = storyUsers.findIndex(u => u.userId === startUserId);\n    if (idx < 0) return storyUsers;\n    return [...storyUsers.slice(idx), ...storyUsers.slice(0, idx)];\n  })();\n\n  const [userIdx, setUserIdx] = useState(0);\n  const [storyIdx, setStoryIdx] = useState(0);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\n  const [paused, setPaused] = useState(false);\n\n  const timerRef = useRef(null);\n  const startTimeRef = useRef(null);\n  const elapsedRef = useRef(0);\n  const videoRef = useRef(null);\n\n  const currentUserData = orderedUsers[userIdx];\n  const currentStories = currentUserData?.stories || [];\n  const currentStory = currentStories[storyIdx];\n  const isOwn = currentUserData?.userId === myUserId;\n  const totalStories = currentStories.length;\n\n  // Mark story as viewed\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!currentStory?.id || !user?.uid) return;\n    if (currentStory.viewerIds?.includes(user.uid)) return;\n    updateDoc(doc(db, \"stories\", currentStory.id), {\n      viewerIds: arrayUnion(user.uid),\n      viewCount: increment(1),\n    }).catch(() => {});\n  }, [currentStory?.id]);\n\n  // Progress timer\n  const startTimer = useCallback(() => {\n    if (timerRef.current) clearInterval(timerRef.current);\n    startTimeRef.current = Date.now() - elapsedRef.current;\n    timerRef.current = setInterval(() => {\n      const elapsed = Date.now() - startTimeRef.current;\n      const pct = Math.min((elapsed / STORY_DURATION) * 100, 100);\n      setProgress(pct);\n      if (pct >= 100) goNext();\n    }, 50);\n  }, [userIdx, storyIdx]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    elapsedRef.current = 0;\n    setProgress(0);\n    if (!paused) startTimer();\n    return () => clearInterval(timerRef.current);\n  }, [userIdx, storyIdx]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (paused) {\n      clearInterval(timerRef.current);\n      elapsedRef.current = Date.now() - startTimeRef.current;\n    } else {\n      startTimer();\n    }\n  }, [paused]);\n\n  function goNext() {\n    clearInterval(timerRef.current);\n    elapsedRef.current = 0;\n    if (storyIdx < totalStories - 1) {\n      setStoryIdx(s => s + 1);\n    } else if (userIdx < orderedUsers.length - 1) {\n      setUserIdx(u => u + 1);\n      setStoryIdx(0);\n    } else {\n      onClose();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function goPrev() {\n    clearInterval(timerRef.current);\n    elapsedRef.current = 0;\n    if (storyIdx > 0) {\n      setStoryIdx(s => s - 1);\n    } else if (userIdx > 0) {\n      setUserIdx(u => u - 1);\n      setStoryIdx(0);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Handle keyboard\n  useEffect(() => {\n    function onKey(e) {\n      if (e.key === \"Escape\") onClose();\n      if (e.key === \"ArrowRight\") goNext();\n      if (e.key === \"ArrowLeft\") goPrev();\n      if (e.key === \" \") setPaused(p => !p);\n    }\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", onKey);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"keydown\", onKey);\n  }, [storyIdx, userIdx]);\n\n  if (!currentStory) { onClose(); return null; }\n\n  const mediaUrl = resolveUrl(currentStory.mediaUrl);\n  const isVideo = currentStory.mediaType === \"video\";\n  const photoUrl = resolveUrl(currentUserData?.userPhoto || null);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"sv-backdrop\" onClick={onClose}>\n      <div className=\"sv-container\" onClick={e => e.stopPropagation()}>\n\n        {/* Progress bars */}\n        <div className=\"sv-progress-row\">\n          {currentStories.map((_, i) => (\n            <div key={i} className=\"sv-progress-track\">\n              <div\n                className=\"sv-progress-fill\"\n                style={{\n                  width: i < storyIdx ? \"100%\" : i === storyIdx ? `${progress}%` : \"0%\"\n                }}\n              />\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"sv-header\">\n          <div className=\"sv-user-row\">\n            {photoUrl\n              ? <img src={photoUrl} alt={currentUserData.username} className=\"sv-avatar\" />\n              : <div className=\"sv-avatar-initial\">{(currentUserData.username || \"W\")[0].toUpperCase()}</div>\n            }\n            <div className=\"sv-user-info\">\n              <span className=\"sv-username\">\n                @{currentUserData.username || \"user\"}\n                {currentUserData.userVerified && <BlueTick size={13} />}\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"sv-time\">{timeAgo(currentStory.createdAt)}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"sv-header-actions\">\n            {isOwn && (\n              <span className=\"sv-views\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f {currentStory.viewCount || 0}</span>\n            )}\n            <button className=\"sv-pause-btn\" onClick={() => setPaused(p => !p)}>\n              {paused ? \"\u25b6\" : \"\u23f8\"}\n            </button>\n            <button className=\"sv-close-btn\" onClick={onClose}>\u2715</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Media */}\n        <div className=\"sv-media-wrap\">\n          {isVideo && mediaUrl ? (\n            <video\n              ref={videoRef}\n              key={currentStory.id}\n              src={mediaUrl}\n              className=\"sv-media\"\n              autoPlay\n              playsInline\n              loop={false}\n              muted={false}\n              onEnded={goNext}\n            />\n          ) : mediaUrl ? (\n            <img src={mediaUrl} alt=\"story\" className=\"sv-media\" />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"sv-media-placeholder\">\ud83e\udd81</div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* Tap zones */}\n          <button className=\"sv-tap-prev\" onClick={goPrev} aria-label=\"Previous\" />\n          <button className=\"sv-tap-next\" onClick={goNext} aria-label=\"Next\" />\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Caption */}\n        {currentStory.caption && (\n          <div className=\"sv-caption\">{currentStory.caption}</div>\n        )}\n\n        {/* User navigation dots */}\n        {orderedUsers.length > 1 && (\n          <div className=\"sv-user-dots\">\n            {orderedUsers.map((_, i) => (\n              <div key={i} className={`sv-user-dot ${i === userIdx ? \"active\" : \"\"}`} />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}, {"type": "tool", "name": "write", "arguments": {"file_path": "artifacts/animal-x/src/components/UploadStory.jsx", "content": "import { useState, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport { collection, addDoc, serverTimestamp } from \"firebase/firestore\";\nimport { db } from \"../utils/firebase\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../context/AuthContext\";\n\nexport default function UploadStory({ onClose, onUploaded }) {\n  const { user, profile } = useAuth();\n  const [file, setFile] = useState(null);\n  const [preview, setPreview] = useState(null);\n  const [caption, setCaption] = useState(\"\");\n  const [uploading, setUploading] = useState(false);\n  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);\n  const [error, setError] = useState(null);\n  const fileInputRef = useRef(null);\n\n  function handleFile(e) {\n    const f = e.target.files?.[0];\n    if (!f) return;\n    if (f.size > 100 * 1024 * 1024) { setError(\"File must be under 100 MB.\"); return; }\n    setFile(f);\n    setPreview(URL.createObjectURL(f));\n    setError(null);\n  }\n\n  const isVideo = file?.type.startsWith(\"video/\");\n  const isImage = file?.type.startsWith(\"image/\");\n\n  async function handlePost() {\n    if (!user) { alert(\"Please login first.\"); return; }\n    if (!file) { setError(\"Please select a photo or video.\"); return; }\n    setUploading(true);\n    setError(null);\n    setProgress(10);\n\n    try {\n      // Upload to Object Storage\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/storage/uploads/request-url\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n        body: JSON.stringify({ name: `story_${user.uid}_${Date.now()}`, size: file.size, contentType: file.type }),\n      });\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"Could not get upload URL\");\n      const { uploadURL, objectPath } = await res.json();\n      setProgress(30);\n\n      await fetch(uploadURL, { method: \"PUT\", headers: { \"Content-Type\": file.type }, body: file });\n      setProgress(80);\n\n      const displayName = profile?.name || profile?.username || user.name || user.email?.split(\"@\")[0] || \"user\";\n      const expiresAt = Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000; // 24 hours\n\n      await addDoc(collection(db, \"stories\"), {\n        userId: user.uid,\n        username: displayName,\n        userVerified: profile?.manualVerified || false,\n        userPhoto: profile?.photo || null,\n        mediaUrl: objectPath,\n        mediaType: isVideo ? \"video\" : \"image\",\n        caption: caption.trim() || null,\n        createdAt: serverTimestamp(),\n        expiresAt,\n        viewerIds: [],\n        viewCount: 0,\n      });\n\n      setProgress(100);\n      onUploaded?.();\n    } catch (e) {\n      setError(\"Upload failed: \" + e.message);\n      setUploading(false);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"upload-backdrop\" onClick={e => { if (e.target === e.currentTarget) onClose(); }}>\n      <div className=\"upload-sheet\" style={{ maxWidth: 420 }}>\n        <div className=\"upload-header\">\n          <button className=\"upload-close-btn\" onClick={onClose}>\u2715</button>\n          <div className=\"upload-header-title\">\ud83d\udcf8 Add Story</div>\n          <div style={{ fontSize: \"0.78rem\", color: \"var(--text2)\", textAlign: \"center\" }}>\n            Stories expire after 24 hours\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"upload-body\">\n          {error && (\n            <div className=\"upload-error-bar\">\u26a0\ufe0f {error}\n              <button onClick={() => setError(null)} className=\"upload-error-dismiss\">\u2715</button>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* Media preview / dropzone */}\n          <div\n            className={`upload-dropzone story-dropzone ${file ? \"has-file\" : \"\"}`}\n            onClick={() => fileInputRef.current?.click()}\n          >\n            {preview ? (\n              isVideo\n                ? <video src={preview} className=\"upload-preview-vid\" muted playsInline loop controls />\n                : <img src={preview} alt=\"preview\" className=\"story-preview-img\" />\n            ) : (\n              <div className=\"upload-dropzone-inner\">\n                <div className=\"upload-dropzone-icon\">\ud83d\udcf7</div>\n                <div className=\"upload-dropzone-title\">Tap to add photo or video</div>\n                <div className=\"upload-dropzone-hint\">Image or Video \u00b7 max 100 MB \u00b7 expires in 24h</div>\n              </div>\n            )}\n          </div>\n          <input\n            ref={fileInputRef}\n            type=\"file\"\n            accept=\"image/*,video/*\"\n            style={{ display: \"none\" }}\n            onChange={handleFile}\n          />\n\n          {file && (\n            <div className=\"upload-file-chip\">\n              \u2705 {file.name}\n              <button className=\"upload-file-remove\" onClick={() => { setFile(null); setPreview(null); }}>\u2715</button>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* Caption */}\n          <div className=\"upload-field\" style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>\n            <label className=\"upload-label\">Caption (optional)</label>\n            <input\n              className=\"upload-input\"\n              value={caption}\n              onChange={e => setCaption(e.target.value)}\n              placeholder=\"Add a caption to your story\u2026\"\n              maxLength={150}\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Progress */}\n          {uploading && (\n            <div className=\"upload-progress-wrap\" style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>\n              <div className=\"upload-progress-track\">\n                <div className=\"upload-progress-fill\" style={{ width: `${progress}%` }} />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"upload-progress-label\">Uploading\u2026 {progress}%</div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"upload-footer\">\n          <button className=\"upload-btn-back\" onClick={onClose}>Cancel</button>\n          <div style={{ flex: 1 }} />\n          <button\n            className=\"upload-btn-post\"\n            onClick={handlePost}\n            disabled={uploading || !file}\n          >\n            {uploading ? `${progress}%\u2026` : \"\ud83d\udcf8 Share Story\"}\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File rewritten successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Reels.jsx"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File rewritten successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/UserProfile.jsx"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File rewritten successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/pages/Search.jsx"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File created successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/components/StoriesRow.jsx"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File created successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/components/StoriesViewer.jsx"}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File created successfully at: artifacts/animal-x/src/components/UploadStory.jsx"}]}]}
